(4299,'itIT','<NYI> <TXT>The Tomb of the Seven','Place the PX83-Enigmatron in the Tomb of the Seven, then return to Maxwort Uberglint. Articolo Fornito:','Find the Tomb of the Seven, and place this PX83-Enigmatron there.'),
