(5666,'deDE','[<UNUSED>]','[Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.]','[Oh, $N, I am pleased to catch you. There has been talk that you are prepared for your next test at the Temple of the Moon. Priestess Alathea herself wishes to speak to you. You should return to Darnassus as quickly as you can. Finish whatever business you have here and make haste.]'),
(5666,'esES','[<UNUSED>]','[Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.]','[Oh, $N, I am pleased to catch you. There has been talk that you are prepared for your next test at the Temple of the Moon. Priestess Alathea herself wishes to speak to you. You should return to Darnassus as quickly as you can. Finish whatever business you have here and make haste.]'),
