(5667,'deDE','[<UNUSED>]','[Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.]','[Aye, good to see you''re doing well in your training, young $Gpriest:priestess;. One of your kind was here looking for you not too long ago. It seems you''re wanted back in Darnassus. Something about Priestess Alathea and the Temple of the Moon. It sounded important. Perhaps you should return there soon.]'),
(5667,'esES','[<UNUSED>]','[Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.]','[Aye, good to see you''re doing well in your training, young $Gpriest:priestess;. One of your kind was here looking for you not too long ago. It seems you''re wanted back in Darnassus. Something about Priestess Alathea and the Temple of the Moon. It sounded important. Perhaps you should return there soon.]'),
