(5693,'deDE','[<NYI> In the Dark It was Created]','[Speak to Aelthalyste in the Undercity.]','[Glad to see you''re... alive, $N.$B$BAelthalyste has asked you to return to the Undercity when you''ve finished your business here in Thunder Bluff. It seems you''ve grown powerful enough that she thinks you''re due new garments... a robe, I believe.$B$BShe''ll be waiting for you in the War Quarter.]'),
