(5706,'deDE','[<NYI> No Longer a Shadow]','[Speak to Aelthalyste in the Undercity.]','[Good to see you again, $N. But I''m gonna have to cut our reunion short--Aelthalyste sent word that you were to return to her in the Undercity. She''s still in the War Quarter.$B$BDon''t worry though--I think it''s a good thing. It was mentioned that she was pleased with your progress, so don''t fret too much.]'),
