(7962,'deDE','Kaninchenfelle','Bringt 3 LeCraft-Kaninchenfelle zu Jon LeCraft.','Ich brauche einige LeCraft-Kaninchenfelle. Besorgt mir einige von den LeCrafty-Kaninchen.$B$BEine wichtige Aufgabe!'),
(7962,'esES','Pieles de conejo','Lleva 3 pieles de conejo Artisane a Jon L''Artesano.','Quiero unas pieles de conejo Artisane. Ve a buscarme unas a Conejos Artisane.$B$B¡Es importante!'),
(7962,'esMX','[Wabbit Pelts]','[Bring 3 LeCrafty Rabbit Pelts to Jon LeCraft.]','[I want LeCrafty rabbit pelts. Get me some from LeCrafty Rabbits.$B$BThis is important!]'),
(7962,'frFR','Peaux de lapins','Apportez 3 peaux de lapins LeCrafty à Jon LeCraft.','Je veux des peaux de lapins LeCrafty. Allez m''en chercher.$B$BC''est très important !'),
(7962,'itIT','Wabbit Pelts','Bring 3 LeCrafty Rabbit Pelts to Jon LeCraft.','I want LeCrafty rabbit pelts. Get me some from LeCrafty Rabbits.$B$BThis is important!'),
(7962,'koKR','토끼 가죽','존 리크래프트에게 리크래프트 토끼 가죽 세 개를 갖다 주어야 합니다.','리크래프트 토끼 가죽이 필요합니다. 리크래프트 토끼를 잡아서 좀 구해 주십시오. $B$B이건 아주 중요합니다!'),
(7962,'ptBR','Pelagens de toelho','Leve 3 Pelagens de Coelho LeCrafty para Jon LeCraft.','Quero pelagens de coelho LeCrafty. Traga-me algumas dos coelhos LeCrafty.$B$BÉ importante!'),
(7962,'ruRU','Кроличьи шкурки','Принесите 3 шкурки кроликов Лекрафта Джону Лекрафту.','Мне нужны шкурки кроликов Лекрафта. Добудь мне несколько штук.$B$BЭто важно!'),
(7962,'zhCN','兔子皮','将3块LeCrafty Rabbit Pelt交给Jon LeCraft。','我想要LeCrafty Rabbit Pelt。去猎杀那些LeCrafty Rabbit吧。$B$B这事儿很重要！'),
(7962,'zhTW','兔皮','帶3張狡猾的兔子的皮給喬恩·勒克夫特。','我要狡猾的兔子的皮。從狡猾的兔子身上取回來給我。$B$B這很重要！'),
