(8274,'itIT','Test Kill Quest','Kill 5 Murlocs and come back to the test character.','Got some time to spare? Kill me some Murlocs and I''ll give you something shiny! Puoi controllare se l''hai già completato digitando:$B /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(8274))'),
(8274,'koKR','Test Kill Quest','Kill 5 Murlocs and come back to the test character.','Got some time to spare? Kill me some Murlocs and I''ll give you something shiny! 이미 완료했는지 확인하려면 다음과 같이 입력하세요:$B /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(8274))'),
