(8917,'itIT','An Earnest Proposition','Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Shadowcraft Bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.','Hail, $C! I can tell by your demeanor that you''ve seen and done much in this world. Yet I''m willing to wager you haven''t seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I''ll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI''m in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus. Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I''ll perform the exchange.'),
