(94774,'zhTW','[Divine Grace]','[Speak to High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind.]','[You''ve caught the attention of our superiors, $N. They''ve asked you travel to the Cathedral of Light in Stormwind as soon as possible. Apparently they feel you''ve proven yourself already and are prepared to further your training. When you get there, find High Priestess Laurena. She will be able to guide you further. Good luck, and may the Light be with you.]'),
(94792,'deDE','Die Bestie zähmen','Benutzt die Zähmerrute, um einen Steinhauteber zu zähmen. Übt Eure Fertigkeiten und bringt die Zähmerrute dann zu Josephine Carson zurück.','Viele Jäger bevorzugen es, mit tierischen Begleitern zu reisen. Mit einer Bestie an Eurer Seite könnt Ihr sogar die gefährlichsten Umstände überleben. Wie man so schön sagt, alles ist einfacher mit einem Freund. Die Beschaffung eines tierischen Begleiters ist jedoch etwas, das mit Vorsicht erfolgen muss. Das Gleichgewicht der Natur ist äußerst empfindlich und muss immer respektiert werden. Nehmt diese Zähmerrute mit in den Wald. Damit könnt Ihr einen Steinhauteber zähmen und Eure Fertigkeiten als Jäger üben.'),
(94792,'esES','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Rockhide Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[Many hunters prefer to travel with animal companions. With a beast at your side, you will find that you can survive even the most dangerous of circumstances. As they say, everything is easier with a friend. However, obtaining an animal companion is something that must be done with care. The balance of nature is delicate, and must always be respected. Take this Taming Rod with you to the forest. With it, you will be able to tame a Rockhide Boar and practice your skills as a hunter.]'),
(94792,'esMX','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Rockhide Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[Many hunters prefer to travel with animal companions. With a beast at your side, you will find that you can survive even the most dangerous of circumstances. As they say, everything is easier with a friend. However, obtaining an animal companion is something that must be done with care. The balance of nature is delicate, and must always be respected. Take this Taming Rod with you to the forest. With it, you will be able to tame a Rockhide Boar and practice your skills as a hunter.]'),
(94792,'frFR','Dompter la bête','Utilisez le bâtonnet de domptage pour dompter un sanglier Rochecuir. Entraînez-vous à ses côtés, puis rapportez le bâtonnet de domptage à Joséphine Carson.','De nombreux chasseurs aiment voyager en compagnie d’animaux. Vous verrez : avec une bête à vos côtés, vous réussirez à survivre aux situations les plus périlleuses. On dit souvent que tout est plus facile en bonne compagnie. Pourtant, il faut faire preuve de considération avant d’adopter un compagnon animal. L’équilibre de la nature est fragile et mérite le plus grand respect. Prenez ce bâtonnet de domptage et rendez-vous dans la forêt. Vous pourrez y apprivoiser un sanglier Rochecuir et perfectionner vos compétences en matière de chasse.'),
(94792,'itIT','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Rockhide Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[Many hunters prefer to travel with animal companions. With a beast at your side, you will find that you can survive even the most dangerous of circumstances. As they say, everything is easier with a friend. However, obtaining an animal companion is something that must be done with care. The balance of nature is delicate, and must always be respected. Take this Taming Rod with you to the forest. With it, you will be able to tame a Rockhide Boar and practice your skills as a hunter.]'),
