(94792,'ptBR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Rockhide Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[Many hunters prefer to travel with animal companions. With a beast at your side, you will find that you can survive even the most dangerous of circumstances. As they say, everything is easier with a friend. However, obtaining an animal companion is something that must be done with care. The balance of nature is delicate, and must always be respected. Take this Taming Rod with you to the forest. With it, you will be able to tame a Rockhide Boar and practice your skills as a hunter.]'),
(94792,'ruRU','Укрощение зверя','Приручите твердошкурого вепря с помощью хлыста приручения. Потренируйтесь, потом верните хлыст приручения Жозефине Карсон.','Многие охотники предпочитают заводить животных-компаньонов. Когда рядом с тобой зверь, легче выжить даже в самой тяжелой ситуации. Оно и понятно – вдвоем с другом всегда все дается проще. Но чтобы завести такого компаньона, нужна осторожность. Природа живет в хрупком равновесии, которое следует уважать. Возьми этот хлыст приручения. С его помощью ты сможешь приручить твердошкурого вепря и попрактиковаться в охотничьих навыках.'),
(94792,'zhCN','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Rockhide Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[Many hunters prefer to travel with animal companions. With a beast at your side, you will find that you can survive even the most dangerous of circumstances. As they say, everything is easier with a friend. However, obtaining an animal companion is something that must be done with care. The balance of nature is delicate, and must always be respected. Take this Taming Rod with you to the forest. With it, you will be able to tame a Rockhide Boar and practice your skills as a hunter.]'),
(94792,'zhTW','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Rockhide Boar. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[Many hunters prefer to travel with animal companions. With a beast at your side, you will find that you can survive even the most dangerous of circumstances. As they say, everything is easier with a friend. However, obtaining an animal companion is something that must be done with care. The balance of nature is delicate, and must always be respected. Take this Taming Rod with you to the forest. With it, you will be able to tame a Rockhide Boar and practice your skills as a hunter.]'),
(94793,'deDE','Die Bestie abrichten','Sprecht mit Isaac Chan in Goldhain.','Ihr könnt jetzt ein Tier zähmen, aber Ihr braucht auch die Fähigkeiten, um es abzurichten. Niemand könnte Euch dies besser beibringen als Isaac Chan, ein lebenslanger Waldmann. Er zeigt Euch, wie Ihr Euer neues Haustier ausbildet. Geht mit dem Wind, $C.'),
(94793,'esES','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94793,'esMX','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94793,'frFR','Entraîner la bête','Parlez à Isaac Chan à Comté-de-l’Or.','Vous avez maintenant les compétences pour dompter un familier, mais vous devez aussi acquérir celles qui sont nécessaires à son apprivoisement. Personne n’est mieux placé pour cela qu’Isaac Chan, un bûcheron de longue date. Il vous apprendra à dresser votre nouveau compagnon animal. Que les vents vous portent, jeune $C.'),
(94793,'itIT','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94793,'koKR','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94793,'ptBR','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94793,'ruRU','Укрощение зверя','Поговорите с Исааком Чаном в Златоземье.','Теперь ты умеешь приручать зверей – осталось научиться их дрессировать. Поговори с Исааком Чаном. Он всю жизнь посвятил лесу и расскажет, как обучать питомцев. Ступай с ветром, <начинающий/начинающая:c> |3-3($C).'),
(94793,'zhCN','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94793,'zhTW','[Training the Beast]','[Speak to Isaac Chan in Goldshire.]','[You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it. For this, there is none better than Isaac Chan, a lifelong woodsman. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. Go with the winds, young $C.]'),
(94863,'deDE','Die Bestie zähmen','Benutzt die Zähmerrute, um einen grauen Forstwolf zu zähmen. Übt Eure Fertigkeiten und bringt die Zähmerrute dann zu Josephine Carson zurück.','Ihr habt bereits meisterhaft einen Eber gezähmt, nun ist es Zeit für die nächste Lektion. Der Wald beherbergt wildere Gefährten und wenn Ihr mit Bedacht handelt, könnt Ihr ihr Vertrauen gewinnen. Nehmt diese Zähmerrute und sucht nach einem grauen Forstwolf. Denkt daran, das Gleichgewicht der Natur muss respektiert werden. Stellt Eure Fertigkeiten als Jäger noch einmal unter Beweis.'),
(94863,'esES','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94863,'esMX','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94863,'frFR','Dompter la bête','Utilisez le bâtonnet de domptage pour dompter un loup forestier gris. Entraînez-vous à ses côtés, puis rapportez le bâtonnet de domptage à Joséphine Carson.','Vous savez déjà apprivoiser un sanglier, passons à la leçon suivante. La forêt abrite des compagnons bien plus féroces. À force de prudence, vous pourrez gagner leur confiance. Prenez ce bâtonnet de domptage et partez à la recherche d’un loup forestier gris. N’oubliez pas que l’équilibre de la nature doit être respecté. Prouvez une fois de plus vos talents en matière de chasse.'),
(94863,'itIT','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94863,'koKR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94863,'ptBR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94863,'ruRU','Укрощение зверя','Приручите серого лесного волка с помощью хлыста приручения. Потренируйтесь, потом верните хлыст приручения Жозефине Карсон.','Ты уже знаешь все, что нужно, о приручении вепрей, и пришло время следующего урока. В лесу водятся куда более опасные компаньоны, и при должной осторожности ты сможешь заслужить их доверие. Возьми хлыст приручения и разыщи серого лесного волка. Помни: природное равновесие следует уважать. Продемонстрируй свое умение охотника еще раз.'),
(94863,'zhCN','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94863,'zhTW','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Gray Forest Wolf. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve already mastered taming a boar. Now it''s time for the next lesson. The forest holds fiercer companions, and with care, you can earn their trust. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Gray Forest Wolf. Remember, nature''s balance must be respected. Prove your skill as a hunter once more.]'),
(94864,'deDE','Die Bestie zähmen','Benutzt die Zähmerrute, um einen jungen Waldbären zu zähmen. Übt Eure Fertigkeiten und bringt die Zähmerrute dann zu Josephine Carson zurück.','Durch das Zähmen eines Ebers und eines Wolfs habt Ihr Euer Können unter Beweis gestellt. Nun ist es an der Zeit für Eure letzte Herausforderung. Elwynns Gleichgewicht ist abhängig von Respekt und Können. Nehmt diese Zähmerrute und sucht nach einem jungen Waldbären. Beweist, dass Ihr das Vertrauen selbst des mächtigsten Begleiters verdienen könnt. Der Abschluss dieser Lektion wird Eure Abstimmung auf Wildtiere vertiefen.'),
(94864,'esES','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94864,'esMX','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94864,'frFR','Dompter la bête','Utilisez le bâtonnet de domptage pour dompter un jeune ours des forêts. Entraînez-vous à ses côtés, puis rapportez le bâtonnet de domptage à Joséphine Carson.','Vous avez fait vos preuves en apprivoisant un sanglier et un loup. À présent, votre dernier défi vous attend. L’équilibre d’Elwynn repose à la fois sur le respect et le savoir-faire. Prenez ce bâtonnet de domptage et partez à la recherche d’un jeune ours des forêts. Démontrez que vous méritez la confiance du plus redoutable des compagnons. En achevant cette leçon, votre affinité avec les bêtes sera renforcée.'),
(94864,'itIT','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94864,'koKR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94864,'ptBR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94864,'ruRU','Укрощение зверя','Приручите молодого лесного медведя с помощью хлыста приручения. Потренируйтесь, потом верните хлыст приручения Жозефине Карсон.','Ты $Gпоказал:показала; себя, приручив вепря и волка, теперь же пробил час последнего испытания. Равновесие в Элвиннском лесу зиждется на уважении и мастерстве. Возьми хлыст приручения и найди молодого лесного медведя. Покажи, что можешь заслужить доверие даже самого могучего компаньона. Этот урок поможет тебе почувствовать более глубокую связь с животными.'),
(94864,'zhCN','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94864,'zhTW','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Young Forest Bear. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Josephine Carson.]','[You''ve proven yourself by taming a boar and a wolf. Now it''s time for your final challenge. Elwynn''s balance depends on respect and skill. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Young Forest Bear. Show that you can earn the trust of even the mightiest companion. Completing this lesson will deepen your attunement to beasts.]'),
(94896,'deDE','Hilfe für die Flüchtlinge','Sammelt 8 zurückgelassene Habe.','Ihr scheint mir fähig zu sein. Ihr reist nicht zufällig in Richtung des Schattenwindwaldes? Ban''aethal liegt tief in seinem Inneren. Wir alle stammen von dort. <Ealaane deutet auf die anderen Flüchtlinge.> Vor Kurzem mussten wir Ban''aethal evakuieren, weil es begann, Richtung Himmel zu fallen. Es geschah so plötzlich und mitten in der Nacht. Falls Ihr in diese Richtung reist, könntet Ihr Ausschau nach zurückgelassenen Habseligkeiten halten? Der Wald und das Dorf sind jetzt viel zu gefährlich für uns, um zurückzukehren.'),
(94896,'esES','Ayuda para los refugiados','Recupera 8 pertenencias abandonadas de las Ruinas de Ban''aethal.','Pareces una persona capaz de echarme una mano. ¿No irás hacia el Bosque Ventosombra, por un casual? Ban''aethal, nuestro hogar, se encuentra en lo más profundo. <Ealaane señala a los demás refugiados>. Hace poco empezó a caer hacia el cielo, y nos vimos obligados a evacuarlo. Ocurrió repentinamente y durante la noche. Si te vas a acercar a Ban''aethal, ¿podrías buscar cualquier pertenencia que hayamos dejado atrás? El bosque y la aldea son demasiado peligrosos como para que podamos volver por ahora.'),
(94896,'esMX','Ayuda para los refugiados','Reúne 8 posesiones abandonadas de las Ruinas de Ban''aethal.','Das la sensación de que eres $Gun aventurero habilidoso:una aventurera habilidosa;. ¿Por casualidad te diriges al Bosque Ventarrosombra? Ban''aethal se encuentra en lo más profundo del bosque. De ahí venimos todos. <Ealaane señala a los demás refugiados.> Hace poco tuvimos que evacuar Ban''aethal, ya que empezó a desmoronarse. Fue algo repentino y ocurrió en plena noche. Si vas en esa dirección, ¿podrías buscar cualquier pertenencia que hayamos dejado atrás? El bosque y la aldea son demasiado peligrosos para regresar ahora.'),
(94896,'frFR','Un coup de main pour les réfugiés','Récupérez 8 effets abandonnés dans les ruines de Ban’aethal.','Vous m’avez tout l’air $Gd’un aventurier compétent:d’une aventurière compétente;. Vous ne seriez pas en chemin pour la forêt de Trombenoire, par hasard ? Ban’aethal est un village situé au cœur de la forêt. C’est de là que nous arrivons. <Ealaane désigne les autres réfugiés d’un geste.> Nous avons dû évacuer Ban’aethal, car la terre commençait à s’effondrer. Ça s’est produit si vite… et en plein milieu de la nuit. Si vous passez par là, pourriez-vous nous rapporter les affaires que nous avons dû abandonner sur place ? La forêt et le village sont trop dangereux pour que nous puissions y retourner.'),
(94896,'itIT','[Aid For The Refugees]','[Collect 8 Abandoned Belongings from the ruins of Ban''aethal.]','[You look like a capable adventurer. Do you happen to be headed towards Shadowgale Forest? Ban''aethal lies deep in the forest; that''s where we''re all from. <Ealaane gestures to the other refugees.> We''ve recently had to evacuate Ban''aethal, as it began to fall into the sky. It was sudden and in the middle of the night. If you are headed that way, would you please look for any belongings left behind? The forest and village are far too dangerous for us to return to now.]'),
(94896,'koKR','피난민 지원','반아이탈 폐허에서 버려진 소지품 8개를 모아야 합니다.','제법 실력 있는 모험가로 보이시는군요. 혹시 그늘돌풍 숲으로 향하시는 길입니까? 반아이탈은 숲 깊숙한 곳에 있습니다. 우리 모두의 고향이지요. <다른 피난민들을 가리키는 엘라네> 최근 반아이탈이 하늘로 무너져 내리기 시작해서 우리는 대피해야 했습니다. 한밤중에 갑작스럽게 벌어진 일이었지요. 그쪽으로 가신다면 두고 온 물건을 찾아봐 주시겠습니까? 지금은 숲도 마을도 너무 위험해서 우리가 돌아갈 수 없습니다.'),
(94896,'ptBR','Auxílio aos refugiados','Colete 8 Pertences Abandonados nas ruínas de Ban''aethal.','Você parece ser $Gum aventureiro:uma aventureira; competente. Por acaso você está indo na direção da Floresta Umbréola? Ban''aethal está nas profundezas da floresta; é de lá que todos nós viemos. <Ealaane indica os outros refugiados.> Tivemos que evacuar Ban''aethal recentemente, pois ela começou a cair para o céu. Foi repentino e no meio da noite. Se esse for seu destino, você poderia procurar pertences que tenham ficado pra trás? A floresta e a aldeia estão perigosas demais para voltarmos agora.'),
(94896,'ruRU','Помощь беженцам','Соберите 8 |4вещь:вещи:вещей; из брошенных пожитков в руинах Бан''этала.','Похоже, ты $Gспособный искатель:способная искательница; приключений. Случайно не в Теневейный лес направляешься? Глубоко в лесу находится Бан''этал, и мы все его бывшие жители. <Эалана указывает на других беженцев.> Нам пришлось покинуть Бан''этал, потому что он начал обрушиваться в небо. Это случилось внезапно и посреди ночи. Если ты направляешься туда, может, поищешь брошенные пожитки? Мы не можем вернуться – в лесу и в деревне слишком опасно.'),
(94896,'zhCN','援助难民','从班艾萨尔废墟收集8件被遗弃的物品。','你看着像是个有本事的冒险者。你碰巧要去影风森林吗？班艾萨尔就在森林深处，那儿是咱们所有人的家。 <埃拉内向其他难民指了指。> 就在最近，我们被迫撤离了班艾萨尔，因为那里开始向天空坠落。事情发生得太突然，而且还是在大半夜。你要是去那边，能顺道帮我们找找落下的东西吗？现在那片林子和村庄对我们来说太危险，根本回不去了。'),
(94896,'zhTW','協助難民','在班奈薩爾的廢墟收集8個棄置的財產。','你看起來算個能幹的冒險者。你有要去影風森林嗎？我們的家鄉班奈薩爾就在森林深處。 <伊菈安向其他難民示意。> 因為班奈薩爾就要掉到天空中，所以我們不得不撤離。這突發事件是在半夜發生的。如果你有要去那裡的話，可以找找有沒有遺留下來的財產嗎？現在的森林和村落太過危險，我們實在沒辦法回去。'),
(94897,'deDE','Das Schicksal eines Geliebten','Findet Resaan in den Ruinen von Ban''aethal.','Falls Ihr nach Ban''aethal reist, habe ich eine selbstsüchtige Bitte. Mein Geliebter, Resaan... Ich glaube, er ist nicht länger Teil dieser Welt. Er ist auf der Suche nach Vorräten umgekehrt, obwohl ich ihn angefleht habe, zu bleiben. Nun ist schon mehr als eine Woche vergangen, und ich befürchte das Schlimmste. Bitte, falls Ihr ihn findet, bringt ihn nach Hause. Falls er von uns gegangen ist, bringt mir sein Erbstück.'),
(94897,'esES','El destino de un amado','Encuentra a Resaan en las Ruinas de Ban''aethal.','Si vas a viajar a Ban''aethal, me gustaría pedirte algo. Mi amor, Resaan... Creo que ya no está entre nosotros. Intentó volver a por provisiones a pesar de que le rogué que se quedara. Ya ha pasado más de una semana y temo lo peor. Sé que lo que pido es algo egoísta, pero si lo encuentras, tráelo a casa. Si ha fallecido... te ruego que me traigas su reliquia familiar.'),
(94897,'esMX','El destino de un ser querido','Busca a Resaan en las ruinas de Ban''aethal.','Si vas a viajar a Ban''aethal, tengo una petición egoísta. Mi amado, Resaan... creo que ya no está más en este mundo. Quiso volver en busca de suministros a pesar de que le rogué que se quedara. Ya pasó más de una semana y temo lo peor. Si lo encuentras, tráelo con vida a casa. Si no sobrevivió, agradecería que me traigas una reliquia suya.'),
(94897,'frFR','Le sort de l’être aimé','Trouvez Resaan dans les ruines de Ban’aethal.','Si vous vous rendez à Ban’aethal, j’ai… une requête très égoïste. Mon amour, Resaan… je crains qu’il ne soit plus de ce monde. Il a voulu retourner au village dans l’espoir de récupérer des fournitures, quand bien même je l’ai supplié de rester. C’était il y a plus d’une semaine et je crains le pire. Je vous en prie, si vous le trouvez, ramenez-le auprès de moi. Et s’il a péri… s’il vous plaît, rapportez-moi ses affaires.'),
(94897,'itIT','[The Fate of a Loved One]','[Find Resaan in the Ruins of Ban''aethal.]','[If you are traveling to Ban''aethal, I have a selfish request. My love, Resaan... I believe is no longer a part of this world. He had tried to go back to get supplies even though I begged him to stay. It has been over a week already and I fear the worst. Please, if you find him, bring him home. If he has perished then I beg you to please bring me his heirloom.]'),
(94897,'koKR','사랑하는 이의 운명','반아이탈 폐허에서 레산을 찾아야 합니다.','반아이탈로 가신다면 이기적인 부탁 하나만 드리겠습니다. 제 사랑 레산은... 이제 이 세상 사람이 아닐지도 모릅니다. 제가 가지 말라고 애원했는데도 보급품을 가지러 돌아가려 했습니다. 벌써 일주일이 넘어서, 최악을 생각하지 않을 수가 없습니다. 부디 레산을 찾으면 집으로 데려와 주세요. 이미 세상을 떠났다면 제발 레산의 가보를 가져다주세요.'),
(94897,'ptBR','O destino de um amor','Encontre Resaan nas ruínas de Ban''aethal.','Se você estiver viajando até Ban''aethal, tenho um pedido egoísta. Acredito que meu amor, Resaan... não faz mais parte deste mundo. Ele tentou voltar para pegar suprimentos, apesar das minhas súplicas para que ficasse. Já faz uma semana, e temo pelo pior. Por favor, se você o encontrar, traga-o de volta. Se ele tiver perecido, imploro que me traga a relíquia dele.'),
(94897,'ruRU','Участь любимого','Найдите Ресаана в руинах Бан''этала.','Если ты направляешься в Бан''этал, у меня есть личная просьба. Мой любимый, Ресаан... я думаю, он навсегда меня покинул. Он хотел вернуться за припасами, хотя я умоляла его не делать этого, и уже неделю не возвращается. Боюсь, случилось худшее. Прошу, если найдешь его, приведи ко мне. Если же он погиб, то, пожалуйста, принеси мне что-нибудь на память о нем.'),
(94897,'zhCN','爱人的命运','在班艾萨尔废墟寻找雷萨恩。','如果你要去班艾萨尔，我有个自私的请求。我的爱人雷萨恩……恐怕已经不在了。当时我苦苦哀求他留下，可他还是非要回去拿补给不可。这都过去一个多星期了，我真怕他出了什么意外。 求求你，要是找到他，请带他回家。要是他真的遭遇了不测，我恳请你把他的传家宝带回来给我。'),
(94897,'zhTW','摯愛之人的命運','在班奈薩爾的廢墟中尋找瑞沙恩。','如果你要去班奈薩爾的話，我有個自私的請求。我的愛人瑞沙恩…我想他已經不在這世上了。雖然我請他留下來，但他還是想回去取得補給品。他離開已經超過一個禮拜了，我怕他已經遭遇不測。 如果找到他的話，請你帶他回家。如果他已經不在了，也麻煩你帶回他的傳家寶。'),
(94911,'deDE','Kind der Natur','Sprecht mit Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.','Seid gegrüßt, <Volk>. Ich sehe, dass viel Potenzial für die Druidenkünste in Euch schlummert. In Thunder Bluff wartet jemand, mit dem Ihr vermutlich sprechen wollt: Turak Runetotem. Er wird Euch zeigen, wie Ihr die Festung des Zirkels des Cenarius in Kalimdor findet, Moonglade. Man wird Euch dort willkommen heißen und die Druiden des Zirkels werden ihr Wissen gern mit Euch teilen. Wie Ihr sagen würdet: Geht mit dem Segen des Windes. Ich wünsche Euch viel Erfolg auf Euren Abenteuern.'),
(94911,'esES','Descendiente de la naturaleza','Habla con Turak Runatótem en Cima del Trueno.','Saludos, joven $R. Veo que tienes un gran potencial para las artes druídicas. Quizá te interese ir a la ciudad de Cima del Trueno y buscar a alguien llamado Turak Runatótem . Él te enseñará cómo llegar a la sede del Círculo Cenarion en Kalimdor, en Claro de la Luna. Allí te recibirán con los brazos abiertos, y los druidas del círculo compartirán contigo sus conocimientos. Como diría tu gente: que el viento te acompañe, joven. Te deseo mucha suerte en tus aventuras.'),
(94911,'esMX','[Child of Nature]','[Speak with Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.]','[Greetings, young $R. I can see that you have much promise in the druidic arts. There is one who you may want to speak with in the city of Thunder Bluff by the name of Turak Runetotem. He will teach you how to reach the stronghold of the Cenarion Circle on Kalimdor, Moonglade. You will be welcomed there, and the druids of the circle will impart their knowledge upon you. As your people would say--go with the wind''s blessing, young one. I wish you good fortune in your adventures.]'),
(94911,'frFR','Enfant de la nature','Parlez à Turak Totem-Runique aux Pitons du Tonnerre.','Salutations, jeune $R. Je vois que vous montrez de grandes dispositions pour les arts druidiques. Je vous invite à parler au dénommé Turak Totem-Runique aux Pitons-du-Tonnerre. Il vous enseignera le secret pour vous rendre au bastion du Cercle cénarien sur Kalimdor, Reflet-de-Lune. Les druides du Cercle vous accueilleront chaleureusement et vous transmettront leur savoir. Maintenant, comme votre peuple le dirait, allez avec la bénédiction du vent, mon enfant. Je vous souhaite bonne chance dans vos aventures.'),
(94911,'itIT','[Child of Nature]','[Speak with Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.]','[Greetings, young $R. I can see that you have much promise in the druidic arts. There is one who you may want to speak with in the city of Thunder Bluff by the name of Turak Runetotem. He will teach you how to reach the stronghold of the Cenarion Circle on Kalimdor, Moonglade. You will be welcomed there, and the druids of the circle will impart their knowledge upon you. As your people would say--go with the wind''s blessing, young one. I wish you good fortune in your adventures.]'),
(94911,'koKR','[Child of Nature]','[Speak with Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.]','[Greetings, young $R. I can see that you have much promise in the druidic arts. There is one who you may want to speak with in the city of Thunder Bluff by the name of Turak Runetotem. He will teach you how to reach the stronghold of the Cenarion Circle on Kalimdor, Moonglade. You will be welcomed there, and the druids of the circle will impart their knowledge upon you. As your people would say--go with the wind''s blessing, young one. I wish you good fortune in your adventures.]'),
