(94911,'zhTW','[Child of Nature]','[Speak with Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.]','[Greetings, young $R. I can see that you have much promise in the druidic arts. There is one who you may want to speak with in the city of Thunder Bluff by the name of Turak Runetotem. He will teach you how to reach the stronghold of the Cenarion Circle on Kalimdor, Moonglade. You will be welcomed there, and the druids of the circle will impart their knowledge upon you. As your people would say--go with the wind''s blessing, young one. I wish you good fortune in your adventures.]'),
(94913,'deDE','Moonglade','Benutzt den Zauber ''Teleportation: Moonglade'', um nach Moonglade zu reisen. Wenn Ihr dort ankommt, sprecht mit Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven.','Alle Druiden sind in den hochheiligen Landen von Moonglade willkommen. Bewahrer Remulos, Moonglades Wächter, wacht über allen Druiden, die hier ihren Winterschlaf halten. Ich bringe Euch den Zauber bei, der es Euch ermöglicht, Euch selbst dorthin zu befördern. Wirkt ihn, wann immer Ihr Moonglades Wissen oder Zuflucht sucht.$B$BAls Eure erste Lektion müsst Ihr nach Moonglade reisen und mit Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven über den Pfad sprechen, auf dem Ihr jetzt wandelt. Viel Glück, $Gjunger Druide:junge Druidin;.'),
(94913,'esES','Claro de la Luna','Utiliza el hechizo "Teletransporte a: Claro de la Luna" para viajar a Claro de la Luna. Cuando llegues, ve al poblado Amparo de la Noche y habla con Dendrita Rafagaestelar.','En las sagradas tierras de Claro de la Luna todos los druidas son bienvenidos. El guardián Rémulos de Claro de la Luna sigue custodiando a los druidas que hibernan allí. Te voy a enseñar el hechizo con el que podrás teletransportarte allí. Utilízalo cuando busques el conocimiento o el consuelo del Claro de la Luna.$B$BComo primera lección aquí, en Azeroth, ve a Claro de la Luna. Busca a Dendrita Rafagaestelar en Amparo de la Noche y háblale del camino que recorres. Buena suerte, joven druida.'),
(94913,'esMX','Claro de la Luna','Utiliza el hechizo "Teletransporte: Claro de la Luna" para viajar a Claro de la Luna. Cuando llegues, ve al poblado Amparo de la Noche y habla con Dendrita Rafagaestelar.','En las sagradas tierras de Claro de la Luna todos los druidas son bienvenidos. El guardián Remulos de Claro de la Luna sigue custodiando a los druidas que hibernan allí. Te enseñaré el hechizo que te permite teletransportarte allí. Utilízalo cuando busques el conocimiento o el consuelo del Claro de la Luna.$B$BComo primera lección aquí en Azeroth, ve a Claro de la Luna. Busca a Dendrita Rafagaestelar en Amparo de la Noche y háblale del camino que recorres. Buena suerte, joven druida.'),
(94913,'frFR','Reflet-de-Lune','Utilisez le sort Téléportation : Reflet-de-Lune pour vous rendre à Reflet-de-Lune. Une fois sur place, allez parler à Dendrite Brasétoile au village de Havrenuit.','Tous les druides sont les bienvenus sur les terres sacrées de Reflet-de-Lune. Le gardien Remulos – le gardien de Reflet-de-Lune – surveille de près tous les druides qui hivernent ici. Je vous enseignerai le charme qui pourra vous transporter là-bas. Utilisez-le chaque fois que vous chercherez la connaissance ou la consolation de cet endroit.$B$BPour votre première leçon sur Azeroth, allez à Reflet-de-Lune et parlez à Dendrite Brasétoile, à Havrenuit, du chemin sur lequel vous vous engagez maintenant. Bonne chance, jeune druide.'),
(94913,'itIT','[Moonglade]','[Use the spell "Teleport: Moonglade" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.]','[All druids are welcomed to the sacred lands of Moonglade. Keeper Remulos--Moonglade''s guardian--keeps watch over all druids who hibernate there. I''ll teach you the spell that lets you transport yourself there. Cast it whenever you seek Moonglade''s knowledge or solace.$B$BAs for your first lesson here on Azeroth, travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven about the path you''re now on. Good luck, young druid.]'),
(94913,'koKR','[Moonglade]','[Use the spell "Teleport: Moonglade" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.]','[All druids are welcomed to the sacred lands of Moonglade. Keeper Remulos--Moonglade''s guardian--keeps watch over all druids who hibernate there. I''ll teach you the spell that lets you transport yourself there. Cast it whenever you seek Moonglade''s knowledge or solace.$B$BAs for your first lesson here on Azeroth, travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven about the path you''re now on. Good luck, young druid.]'),
(94913,'ptBR','[Moonglade]','[Use the spell "Teleport: Moonglade" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.]','[All druids are welcomed to the sacred lands of Moonglade. Keeper Remulos--Moonglade''s guardian--keeps watch over all druids who hibernate there. I''ll teach you the spell that lets you transport yourself there. Cast it whenever you seek Moonglade''s knowledge or solace.$B$BAs for your first lesson here on Azeroth, travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven about the path you''re now on. Good luck, young druid.]'),
(94913,'ruRU','Лунная поляна','При помощи заклинания "Телепортация: Лунная поляна" перенеситесь на Лунную поляну. По прибытии поговорите с Дендритом Блеском Звезд в селении Ночная Гавань.','На священной земле Лунной поляны рады всем друидам. Хранитель Ремул – страж Лунной поляны – присматривает за всеми здешними погруженными в спячку друидами. Я научу тебя заклинанию, которое позволит тебе переноситься на Лунную поляну. Пользуйся им, когда захочешь приобщиться знаниям или насладиться покоем.$B$BВот первый урок здесь, на Азероте, – отправляйся на Лунную поляну и поговори с Дендритом Блеском Звезд в Ночной гавани о том пути, которым ты ныне следуешь. Удачи тебе, мой юный друид.'),
(94913,'zhCN','[Moonglade]','[Use the spell "Teleport: Moonglade" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.]','[All druids are welcomed to the sacred lands of Moonglade. Keeper Remulos--Moonglade''s guardian--keeps watch over all druids who hibernate there. I''ll teach you the spell that lets you transport yourself there. Cast it whenever you seek Moonglade''s knowledge or solace.$B$BAs for your first lesson here on Azeroth, travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven about the path you''re now on. Good luck, young druid.]'),
(94913,'zhTW','[Moonglade]','[Use the spell "Teleport: Moonglade" to travel to Moonglade. When you arrive, speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.]','[All druids are welcomed to the sacred lands of Moonglade. Keeper Remulos--Moonglade''s guardian--keeps watch over all druids who hibernate there. I''ll teach you the spell that lets you transport yourself there. Cast it whenever you seek Moonglade''s knowledge or solace.$B$BAs for your first lesson here on Azeroth, travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven about the path you''re now on. Good luck, young druid.]'),
(94978,'deDE','Die Bestie zähmen','Benutzt die Zähmerrute, um einen Windweisenkriecher in der Nähe von Gewässern zu zähmen. Übt Eure Fertigkeiten und bringt die Zähmerrute dann zu Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar zurück.','Jeder Jäger lernt zuerst das Band zwischen Bestie und Meister kennen. Dies ist Eure erste Herausforderung. Bald werdet Ihr Kreaturen aus jeder Ecke der Welt zähmen, aber jetzt beginnt Ihr einmal hier, inmitten der Flüsse und Seen auf Zephras. Nehmt diese Zähmerrute und sucht nach einem Windweisenkriecher. Beweist, dass Ihr sein Vertrauen erlangen könnt. Das ist der erste Schritt auf Eurem Weg zu wahrer Meisterschaft.'),
(94978,'esES','Domar a la bestia','Utiliza la fusta de domador para domar a un reptador Canzalvaje cerca de masas de agua. Practica tus habilidades y después devuélvele la fusta de domador a Quel''ana Prestovendaval en Valanaar.','Cada cazador empieza aprendiendo el vínculo entre la bestia y su maestro. Este es el primer desafío. Con el tiempo domarás criaturas de todos los rincones del mundo; pero, por ahora, puedes empezar en los ríos y lagos de Zephras. Toma esta fusta de domador y ve en busca de un reptador Canzalvaje. Demuestra que puedes ganarte su confianza y comienza tu camino hacia la maestría en la doma de bestias.'),
(94978,'esMX','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Windsong Crawler found near bodies of water. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[Every hunter begins by learning the bond between beast and master. This is your first challenge. In time, you''ll tame creatures from every corner of the world, but for now, start with our rivers and lakes on Zephras. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Windsong Crawler. Show that you can earn its trust, and begin your path toward true mastery.]'),
(94978,'frFR','Dompter la bête','Utilisez le bâtonnet de domptage pour dompter un clampant chantevent près d’un point d’eau. Entraînez-vous à combattre à ses côtés, puis rapportez le bâtonnet de domptage à Quel’ana Vent-Vif à Valanaar.','Pour débuter, tout chasseur doit apprendre à comprendre le lien qui unit la bête et son maître. C’est là votre premier défi. Avec le temps, vous apprivoiserez des créatures venues des quatre coins du monde, mais pour aujourd’hui, commencez par nos rivières et nos lacs sur Zéphras. Prenez ce bâtonnet de domptage et partez à la recherche d’un clampant chantevent. Montrez-lui que vous êtes capable de gagner sa confiance, et engagez-vous sur la voie vers la véritable maîtrise des bêtes.'),
(94978,'itIT','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Windsong Crawler found near bodies of water. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[Every hunter begins by learning the bond between beast and master. This is your first challenge. In time, you''ll tame creatures from every corner of the world, but for now, start with our rivers and lakes on Zephras. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Windsong Crawler. Show that you can earn its trust, and begin your path toward true mastery.]'),
(94978,'koKR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Windsong Crawler found near bodies of water. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[Every hunter begins by learning the bond between beast and master. This is your first challenge. In time, you''ll tame creatures from every corner of the world, but for now, start with our rivers and lakes on Zephras. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Windsong Crawler. Show that you can earn its trust, and begin your path toward true mastery.]'),
(94978,'ptBR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Windsong Crawler found near bodies of water. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[Every hunter begins by learning the bond between beast and master. This is your first challenge. In time, you''ll tame creatures from every corner of the world, but for now, start with our rivers and lakes on Zephras. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Windsong Crawler. Show that you can earn its trust, and begin your path toward true mastery.]'),
(94978,'ruRU','Укрощение зверя','С помощью хлыста приручения приручите ползуна Песни Ветра у водоема. Поупражняйтесь, затем верните хлыст приручения Кве''лане Быстрый Порыв в Валанааре.','Каждому охотнику нужен верный питомец, любящий своего хозяина. Это будет твое первое испытание. Когда-нибудь ты станешь приручать зверей со всех концов света, но пока начни на реках и озерах Зефриса. Возьми этот хлыст приручения и найди ползуна Песни Ветра. Покажи, что умеешь дрессировать зверей, и начни свой путь к настоящему мастерству.'),
(94978,'zhCN','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame a Windsong Crawler found near bodies of water. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[Every hunter begins by learning the bond between beast and master. This is your first challenge. In time, you''ll tame creatures from every corner of the world, but for now, start with our rivers and lakes on Zephras. Take this Taming Rod and seek out a Windsong Crawler. Show that you can earn its trust, and begin your path toward true mastery.]'),
(94978,'zhTW','馴服野獸','在水域附近使用馴獸棒馴服一隻風歌蟹。 練習你的技能，然後將馴獸棒還給瓦拉納爾的奎爾安娜‧快颺。','每個獵人一開始要學的就是與野獸締結連結。這是你的第一項挑戰。隨著經驗的累積，你將能馴服世界各處的生物，但現在先從微風島的水域開始練習吧。 帶著這根馴獸棒，然後找出風歌蟹。 贏得牠的信任，踏上獵人之道。'),
(94979,'deDE','Die Bestie zähmen','Benutzt die Zähmerrute, um einen störrischen Windschreiter im Böenbeerentiefland zu zähmen. Übt Eure Fertigkeiten und bringt die Zähmerrute dann zu Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar zurück.','Ihr habt bewiesen, dass Ihr Wasserbewohner zähmen könnt. Jetzt ist es Zeit, Euch auf festem Boden zu beweisen. In den Ebenen von Zephras hallen die Schreie der Windschreiter wider - stolzer, geflügelter Jäger, die laufen wie der Wind. Nehmt diese Zähmerrute und sucht einen. Reist ins Tiefland und verdient Euch sein Vertrauen. Beweist damit, dass Ihr bereit für die kommenden Prüfungen seid.'),
(94979,'esES','Domar a la bestia','Utiliza la fusta de domador para domar a un zancavendavales malhumorado en las Tierras Bajas de los Soplabayas. Practica tus habilidades y después devuélvele la fusta de domador a Quel''ana Prestovendaval, que está en Valanaar.','Has logrado domar al reptador del río, así que es el momento de poner a prueba tu habilidad a campo abierto. En las llanuras de Zephras se oyen los aullidos del zancavendavales, un cazador alado que corre como el viento. Toma esta fusta de domador y busca uno. Viaja a las Tierras Bajas y gánate su confianza. Demuestra que estás $Glisto:lista; para las pruebas que te aguardan.'),
(94979,'esMX','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ornery Galestrider in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[You''ve proven you can tame the river''s crawler. Now it''s time to test your skill on open ground. The plains of Zephras echo with the cries of the galestrider, a proud, winged hunter that runs like the wind. Take this Taming Rod and seek one out. Travel to the lowlands and earn its trust. Show you''re ready for the trials yet to come.]'),
(94979,'frFR','Dompter la bête','Utilisez le bâtonnet de domptage pour dompter un trotteur des trombes hargneux des plaines Aérelles. Entraînez-vous à combattre à ses côtés, puis rapportez le bâtonnet de domptage à Quel’ana Vent-Vif à Valanaar.','Vous avez fait vos preuves en apprivoisant le clampant des rivières. À présent, il est temps de mettre vos talents à l’épreuve en terrain ouvert. Les plaines de Zéphras sont le théâtre des cris du trotteur des trombes, un fier chasseur ailé qui court aussi vite que le vent. Prenez ce bâtonnet de domptage et partez à sa recherche. Rendez-vous dans les plaines et gagnez sa confiance. Montrez que vous êtes $Gprêt:prête; pour les épreuves à venir.'),
(94979,'itIT','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ornery Galestrider in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[You''ve proven you can tame the river''s crawler. Now it''s time to test your skill on open ground. The plains of Zephras echo with the cries of the galestrider, a proud, winged hunter that runs like the wind. Take this Taming Rod and seek one out. Travel to the lowlands and earn its trust. Show you''re ready for the trials yet to come.]'),
(94979,'koKR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ornery Galestrider in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[You''ve proven you can tame the river''s crawler. Now it''s time to test your skill on open ground. The plains of Zephras echo with the cries of the galestrider, a proud, winged hunter that runs like the wind. Take this Taming Rod and seek one out. Travel to the lowlands and earn its trust. Show you''re ready for the trials yet to come.]'),
(94979,'ptBR','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ornery Galestrider in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[You''ve proven you can tame the river''s crawler. Now it''s time to test your skill on open ground. The plains of Zephras echo with the cries of the galestrider, a proud, winged hunter that runs like the wind. Take this Taming Rod and seek one out. Travel to the lowlands and earn its trust. Show you''re ready for the trials yet to come.]'),
(94979,'ruRU','Укрощение зверя','С помощью хлыста приручения приручите буренога в низине Шен''дар. Поупражняйтесь, затем верните хлыст приручения Кве''лане Быстрый Порыв в Валанааре.','Ты $Gпоказал, что способен:показала; что способна;, приручить речного ползуна, теперь испытаем твои умения на равнине. Поля Зефриса оглашают крики буреногов – гордых крылатых охотников, бегущих со скоростью ветра. Возьми хлыст приручения, ступай в низину и отыщи буренога. Заслужи его доверие и приручи. Докажи, что ты $Gготов:готова; к предстоящим испытаниям.'),
(94979,'zhCN','[Taming the Beast]','[Use the Taming Rod to tame an Ornery Galestrider in the Gustberry Lowlands. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Quel''ana Quickgale in Valanaar.]','[You''ve proven you can tame the river''s crawler. Now it''s time to test your skill on open ground. The plains of Zephras echo with the cries of the galestrider, a proud, winged hunter that runs like the wind. Take this Taming Rod and seek one out. Travel to the lowlands and earn its trust. Show you''re ready for the trials yet to come.]'),
(94979,'zhTW','馴服野獸','在風莓低地使用馴獸棒馴服一隻暴躁的逐風者。 練習你的技能，然後將馴獸棒還給瓦拉納爾的奎爾安娜‧快颺。','你證明自己能夠馴服河蟹，現在該接受開放環境的挑戰了。微風島的平原上有許多逐風者，牠們是性情孤傲、迅如疾風的羽翼獵人。 帶著這根馴獸棒，然後找出逐風者。到低地那邊贏得牠的信任。 證明自己夠格接受後續的考驗。'),
(95314,'deDE','Ein Elixier so grün wie das Schattental','Sammelt 8 Flaschen mit flüsterndem Elixier aus Schattental und kehrt dann zu Carolai Anise in Brill zurück.','Vor der Invasion der Geißel war das zurückgezogene Dorf Schattental für sein flüsterndes Elixier bekannt. Destilliert aus Kräutern, die sich nur in Tyrs Fall finden lassen, war das Elixier bei Apothekern, Mystikern und Giftmischern gleichermaßen begehrt, selbst, nachdem es in der Stadt verboten wurde. Ich habe Nachfragen von einer ganzen Reihe an Interessenten, die es gar nicht erwarten können, das Elixier in die Hände zu bekommen. Reist nach Westen, zu den Ruinen Schattentals tief im Flüsternden Wald. Euch erwartet eine beträchtliche Kompensation, wenn Ihr mir einige Flaschen beschaffen könnt.'),
(95314,'esES','El elixir verde de Sombravalle','Recoge 8 botellas de elixir susurrante en Sombravalle y después ve a ver a Carolai Anise en Rémol.','Antes de la invasión de la Plaga, la apartada aldea de Sombravalle era famosa por su elixir susurrante. Este elixir se destilaba a partir de unas hierbas que solo se encontraban en Caída de Tyr, y era codiciado por boticarios, místicos y envenenadores por igual, incluso después de que lo prohibieran en la ciudad. He recibido peticiones de varios compradores deseosos de hacerse con un poco de aquel elixir. Viaja hasta las ruinas de Sombravalle, en lo más profundo del Bosque Susurrante, al oeste. Te ofreceré una recompensa considerable si consigues traerme algunas botellas.'),
(95314,'esMX','Aquel elixir verde de Vallesombra','Reúne 8 botellas de elixir susurrante en Vallesombra y regresa con Carolai Anise en Rémol.','Antes de la invasión de la Plaga, la aislada aldea de Vallesombra era conocida por su elixir susurrante. El elixir, hecho con hierbas que solo se encuentran en la Cascada de Tyr, era muy buscado por los boticarios, los místicos y los fabricantes de veneno, incluso después de que lo prohibieran en la ciudad. Tengo pedidos de bastantes clientes que quieren poner sus manos en el elixir. Viaja a las ruinas de Vallesombra, en las profundidades del Bosque Susurrante, al oeste. Estoy dispuesta a pagar una gran suma si logras conseguirme algunas botellas.'),
(95314,'frFR','Cet élixir vert d’Ombreval','Récupérez 8 bouteilles d’élixir des murmures à Ombreval, puis retournez voir Carolai Anise à Brill.','Avant l’invasion du Fléau, le village reculé d’Ombreval était connu pour son élixir des murmures. Distillé à partir d’herbes qu’on ne trouve qu’au Trépas de Tyr, cet élixir était particulièrement recherché des apothicaires, des mystiques et des empoisonneurs même après avoir été interdit dans la ville. J’ai plusieurs requêtes d’un certain nombre d’acheteurs impatients de mettre la main sur un peu d’élixir. Rendez-vous dans les ruines d’Ombreval, loin au cœur de la forêt des Murmures, à l’ouest. Je suis prête à vous offrir une rémunération conséquente si vous parvenez à m’en rapporter quelques bouteilles.'),
(95314,'itIT','[That Shadowvale Green Elixir]','[Collect 8 Bottles of Whispering Elixir from Shadowvale, then return to Carolai Anise in Brill.]','[Before the Scourge invasion, the reclusive village of Shadowvale was known for its Whispering Elixir. Distilled from herbs found only in Tyr''s Fall, the elixir was sought by apothecaries, mystics, and poisoners alike even after being banned in the city. I''ve had requests from a number of buyers eager to get their hands on some elixir. Travel to the ruins of Shadowvale deep in the Whispering Forest to the west. I''m prepared to offer significant compensation if you can recover some bottles for me.]'),
(95314,'koKR','어둠골짜기의 녹색 비약','어둠골짜기에서 속삭이는 비약의 병 8개를 모은 후 브릴에 있는 캐롤라이 아니즈에게 가야 합니다.','스컬지 침공 전, 외딴 마을 어둠골짜기는 속삭이는 비약으로 이름이 높았어요. 티르의 최후에서만 자라는 약초로 증류한 비약인데, 도시에서 금지된 뒤에도 연금술사와 비술사, 독술사들이 앞다퉈 찾았죠. 비약을 손에 넣고 싶다는 구매자들의 요청이 꽤 많이 들어왔어요. 서쪽 속삭이는 숲 깊은 곳에 있는 어둠골짜기 폐허로 가주세요. 비약 몇 병을 회수해 오신다면 후하게 보상해 드릴게요.'),
(95314,'ptBR','O elixir verde do Vale das Sombras','Colete 8 Garrafas de Elixir Sussurrante no Vale das Sombras e fale novamente com Carolai Anise em Montalvo.','Antes da invasão do Flagelo, o Vale das Sombras, vilarejo isolado, era conhecido pelo Elixir Sussurrante. Destilado de ervas encontradas somente na Queda de Tyr, o elixir era muito procurado por boticários, místicos e preparadores de veneno, mesmo depois de ser proibido na cidade. Recebi muitos pedidos de compradores ávidos pelo elixir. Vá até as ruínas do Vale das Sombras, nas profundezas da Floresta do Sussurro, a oeste. Estou disposta a lhe oferecer compensação substancial se conseguir recuperar algumas garrafas para mim.'),
(95314,'ruRU','Зеленый эликсир из Тенедола','Добудьте 8 |4бутылку:бутылки:бутылок; шепчущего эликсира в Тенедоле, а затем вернитесь к Каролай Анис в Брилл.','До нашествия Плети уединенная деревушка Тенедол славилась своим шепчущим эликсиром. Его изготавливали из трав, растущих только в Гибели Тира, и даже после того как его запретили продавать в городе, эликсир пользовался большим спросом среди аптекарей, мистиков и ценителей ядов. Уже не один заинтересованный покупатель просил меня его раздобыть. Отправляйся вглубь Шепчущего леса и на восток – там найдешь руины Тенедола. Если добудешь мне несколько бутылок, я хорошо заплачу тебе за труды.'),
(95314,'zhCN','影谷的绿色饮剂','从影谷收集8个低语饮剂瓶，然后回到布瑞尔交给卡罗莱·安尼斯。','天灾军团入侵前，与世隔绝的影谷村曾以低语饮剂闻名。这种饮剂从仅生长于提尔之陨的草药中蒸馏而来，即便在城内被禁，依然备受药剂师、秘术师与制毒者的狂热追捧。 我已经收到许多买家的请求，他们迫切希望能弄到这种饮剂。前往西边耳语森林深处的影谷废墟吧。若你能为我带回几瓶，我会付你一笔丰厚的报酬。'),
(95314,'zhTW','暗影谷綠色藥劑','到暗影谷收集8瓶低語藥劑，然後回到布瑞爾找卡羅萊‧安尼斯。','天譴軍團入侵之前，隱匿的暗影谷村落最為出名的就是低語藥劑了。這種藥劑是由提爾之殞的草藥蒸餾而成，就算後來這種藥劑在城中被禁用，藥劑師、秘法師和毒藥師還是慕名而來。 我有一些買家很想得到這樣的藥劑。到低語森林西邊深處的暗影谷廢墟。如果你能找到一些，我會好好獎賞你的。'),
(95349,'deDE','Der Irdene Ring','Nehmt das Himmelsseglerschiff von der Insel Zephras nach Mulgore und sprecht mit Alaana Stormwalker, wenn Ihr ankommt.','Die jüngsten Ereignisse rund um den Kult haben meine Pläne, nach Azeroth zu reisen, verzögert, und ich muss vorerst hier in Valanaar bleiben. Deswegen werdet Ihr und eine Handvoll anderer Windformer unsere Vorhut bilden. Alaana Stormwalker wird Euch bei Eurer Ankunft in Mulgore erwarten. Ich würde Euch empfehlen, Azeroth zu erkunden, während wir hier unsere Angelegenheiten regeln. Wir werden uns Euch zeitnah anschließen. Wenn Ihr soweit seid, geht einfach zum Dock außerhalb dieser Behausung hier und betretet das Himmelsseglerschiff. Banu-Alah, $N.'),
(95349,'esES','El Anillo de la Tierra','Súbete al cortacielos que viaja de la Isla de Zephras a Mulgore y habla con Alaana Caminatormentas.','Los acontecimientos recientes con el culto han retrasado mis planes de viajar a Azeroth, por lo que permaneceré un tiempo en Valanaar. En cambio, un grupo de formavientos y tú seréis nuestra avanzadilla. Alaana Caminatormentas te estará esperando en Mulgore. Te animo a explorar Azeroth mientras concluimos nuestros asuntos aquí. Pronto nos reuniremos contigo. Cuando lo tengas todo listo, dirígete al muelle que hay fuera de aquí y súbete al cortacielos. Banu-Alah, $N.'),
(95349,'esMX','[The Earthen Ring]','[Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive.]','[The recent events with the cult have delayed my plans to travel to Azeroth and I must remain here in Valanaar for a time. You and a handful of other Windshapers will be our vanguard instead. Alaana Stormwalker will be waiting to receive our Windshapers upon arrival in Mulgore, and I''d encourage you to explore Azeroth while we finish our business here. We will join you soon. When you are ready, please proceed to the dock just outside this lodge and board the skycutter ship there. Banu-Alah, $N.]'),
(95349,'frFR','Le Cercle terrestre','Embarquez à bord d’un perceciel au départ de l’île de Zéphras pour vous rendre en Mulgore, puis parlez à Alana Marchetempête à votre arrivée.','J’ai dû reporter mon voyage vers Azeroth à cause des derniers évènements concernant la secte. Je dois rester ici, à Valanaar, encore un moment. Vous, ainsi qu’une poignée d’autres Sculpte-vents, allez nous servir d’avant-garde. Alaana Marchetempête vous accueillera à votre arrivée à Mulgore. Je vous conseille d’explorer Azeroth pendant que nous réglons tout ça. Nous vous contacterons bientôt. Quand vous serez $Gprêt:prête;, rendez-vous sur le quai devant ce bâtiment et montez à bord du perceciel qui s’y trouve. Banu-Alah, $N.'),
(95349,'itIT','[The Earthen Ring]','[Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive.]','[The recent events with the cult have delayed my plans to travel to Azeroth and I must remain here in Valanaar for a time. You and a handful of other Windshapers will be our vanguard instead. Alaana Stormwalker will be waiting to receive our Windshapers upon arrival in Mulgore, and I''d encourage you to explore Azeroth while we finish our business here. We will join you soon. When you are ready, please proceed to the dock just outside this lodge and board the skycutter ship there. Banu-Alah, $N.]'),
(95349,'koKR','[The Earthen Ring]','[Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive.]','[The recent events with the cult have delayed my plans to travel to Azeroth and I must remain here in Valanaar for a time. You and a handful of other Windshapers will be our vanguard instead. Alaana Stormwalker will be waiting to receive our Windshapers upon arrival in Mulgore, and I''d encourage you to explore Azeroth while we finish our business here. We will join you soon. When you are ready, please proceed to the dock just outside this lodge and board the skycutter ship there. Banu-Alah, $N.]'),
(95349,'ptBR','[The Earthen Ring]','[Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive.]','[The recent events with the cult have delayed my plans to travel to Azeroth and I must remain here in Valanaar for a time. You and a handful of other Windshapers will be our vanguard instead. Alaana Stormwalker will be waiting to receive our Windshapers upon arrival in Mulgore, and I''d encourage you to explore Azeroth while we finish our business here. We will join you soon. When you are ready, please proceed to the dock just outside this lodge and board the skycutter ship there. Banu-Alah, $N.]'),
(95349,'ruRU','Служители Земли','Отправьтесь на неборезе с острова Зефрис в Мулгор. По прибытии поговорите с Алаана Штормовой Полет.','Из-за недавних событий, связанных с культом, мне придется отложить путешествие по Азероту и на время остаться в Валанааре. Вместо меня мы отправим отряд Ваятелей ветра – ты будешь в числе этих первопроходцев. Алаана Штормовой Полет встретит тебя в Мулгоре. Пока мы занимаемся делами здесь, советую тебе начать исследовать Азерот. Скоро мы тоже туда прибудем. Когда будешь $Gготов:готова;, иди на ближний причал и садись на неборез. Бану-ала, $N.'),
(95349,'zhCN','[The Earthen Ring]','[Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive.]','[The recent events with the cult have delayed my plans to travel to Azeroth and I must remain here in Valanaar for a time. You and a handful of other Windshapers will be our vanguard instead. Alaana Stormwalker will be waiting to receive our Windshapers upon arrival in Mulgore, and I''d encourage you to explore Azeroth while we finish our business here. We will join you soon. When you are ready, please proceed to the dock just outside this lodge and board the skycutter ship there. Banu-Alah, $N.]'),
(95349,'zhTW','[The Earthen Ring]','[Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alaana Stormwalker when you arrive.]','[The recent events with the cult have delayed my plans to travel to Azeroth and I must remain here in Valanaar for a time. You and a handful of other Windshapers will be our vanguard instead. Alaana Stormwalker will be waiting to receive our Windshapers upon arrival in Mulgore, and I''d encourage you to explore Azeroth while we finish our business here. We will join you soon. When you are ready, please proceed to the dock just outside this lodge and board the skycutter ship there. Banu-Alah, $N.]'),
(95350,'deDE','Willkommen in Azeroth','Reist nach Orgrimmar und sprecht mit Thrall im Tal der Weisheit.','Hier wartet eine große Welt und unsere neuen Verbündeten sind entscheidend für unser Überleben. Der Irdene Ring ist ein Mitglied der Horde, einer stolzen Gruppe Gleichgesinnter. Die nahe Stadt Thunder Bluff gehört zur Horde und weiter im Osten liegt die Hauptstadt Orgrimmar. Besucht den Flugmeister im Zentrum von Thunder Bluff. Er bringt Euch nach Orgrimmar, wo Ihr den Kriegshäuptling der Horde Thrall in Vertretung der Windformer trefft. Mögen die Winde Euch leiten, $N.'),
(95350,'esES','La bienvenida a Azeroth','Viaja a Orgrimmar y habla con Thrall, que está en el Valle de la Sabiduría.','Nos espera un gran mundo aquí abajo, y nuestros nuevos aliados son la clave para la supervivencia. El Anillo de la Tierra es un miembro de la "Horda", un orgulloso grupo de individuos de ideas similares. La ciudad cercana, Cima del Trueno, es parte de la Horda. Y, más al este, se encuentra su capital, Orgrimmar. Busca al maestro de vuelo en el centro de Cima del Trueno. Iréis volando a Orgrimmar, donde conocerás al jefe de guerra de la Horda, Thrall, en nombre de los Formavientos. Que el viento te guíe, $N.'),
(95350,'esMX','Bienvenido a Azeroth','Viaja a Orgrimmar y habla con Thrall en el Valle de la Sabiduría.','Este es un mundo grande, y nuestros nuevos aliados son fundamentales para nuestra supervivencia. El Anillo de la Tierra es una agrupación que pertenece a la "Horda", un conjunto orgulloso de personas con opiniones similares. La ciudad cercana de Cima del Trueno es una parte de la Horda, y más al este se encuentra la ciudad de Orgrimmar. Busca al maestro de vuelo en el centro de Cima del Trueno para volar a Orgrimmar, donde podrás tener una audiencia con el jefe de guerra de la Horda, Thrall, en nombre de los Formavientos. Que los vientos te guíen, $N.'),
(95350,'frFR','Bienvenue sur Azeroth','Voyagez jusqu’à Orgrimmar et parlez à Thrall dans la vallée de la Sagesse.','Ce monde est vaste, et nos nouveaux alliés sont la clé de notre survie. Le Cercle terrestre fait partie de la « Horde », une fière communauté de peuples partageant les mêmes idéaux. La ville voisine, les Pitons-du-Tonnerre, appartient à la Horde, et plus à l’est se trouve la capitale, Orgrimmar. Allez voir le maître de vol au centre des Pitons-du-Tonnerre. Il vous transportera à Orgrimmar, où vous rencontrerez le chef de guerre de la Horde, Thrall, au nom des Sculpte-vents. Que les vents vous guident, $N.'),
(95350,'itIT','[Welcome to Azeroth]','[Travel to Orgrimmar and speak with Thrall in the Valley of Wisdom.]','[It''s a big world down here, and our new allies are the key to our survival. The Earthen Ring is a member of the "Horde", a proud collection of like-minded peoples. The nearby city of Thunder Bluff is a part of the Horde, and further to the east lies the capital of Orgrimmar. Seek out the flight master in the center of Thunder Bluff. They will fly you to Orgrimmar where you will make contact with the Horde warchief--Thrall, on behalf of the Windshapers. Winds guide you, $N.]'),
(95350,'koKR','아제로스에 오신 걸 환영합니다','오그리마로 이동한 후 지혜의 골짜기에서 스랄과 대화해야 합니다.','이 아래의 세상은 아주 넓고, 우리의 생존에는 새로운 동맹이 핵심입니다. 대지 고리회는 뜻을 같이하는 긍지 높은 여러 민족의 모임인 "호드"에 속해 있습니다. 가까운 도시 썬더 블러프도 호드의 일부이고, 더 동쪽에는 수도 오그리마가 있습니다. 썬더 블러프 중심부의 비행 조련사를 찾아가세요. 비행 조련사가 오그리마까지 태워 줄 것이고, 그곳에서 바람구체자를 대표해 호드의 대족장 스랄을 만나게 될 겁니다. 바람이 인도하길, $N.'),
(95350,'ptBR','Boas-vindas a Azeroth','Viaje a Orgrimmar e fale com Thrall no Vale da Sabedoria.','O mundo aqui é vasto, e a nossa sobrevivência depende dos nossos novos aliados. A Harmonia Telúrica pertence à "Horda", um aglomerado de povos que orgulhosamente partilha dos mesmos princípios. Penhasco do Trovão, a cidade próxima daqui, é domínio da Horda, e mais a leste se encontra a capital de Orgrimmar. Procure o Mestre de Voo no centro do Penhasco do Trovão. Ele $Go:a; levará a Orgrimmar, onde você travará contato com o Chefe Guerreiro da Horda, Thrall, em nome dos Moldavento. Que os ventos $Go:a; guiem, $N.'),
(95350,'ruRU','Добро пожаловать на Азерот','Отправляйтесь в Оргриммар и поговорите с Траллом на аллее Мудрости.','Здесь, внизу, раскинулся большой мир, и новые союзники – ключ к нашему выживанию. Служители Земли – часть Орды, объединяющей много гордых единомышленников. Город Громовой Утес – одно из поселений Орды, а к востоку находится ее столица Оргриммар. Обратись к распорядителю полетов в центре Громового Утеса, чтобы полететь в Оргриммар, и переговори с вождем Орды Траллом от имени Ваятелей ветра. Пусть ветра направляют тебя, $N.'),
(95350,'zhCN','[Welcome to Azeroth]','[Travel to Orgrimmar and speak with Thrall in the Valley of Wisdom.]','[It''s a big world down here, and our new allies are the key to our survival. The Earthen Ring is a member of the "Horde", a proud collection of like-minded peoples. The nearby city of Thunder Bluff is a part of the Horde, and further to the east lies the capital of Orgrimmar. Seek out the flight master in the center of Thunder Bluff. They will fly you to Orgrimmar where you will make contact with the Horde warchief--Thrall, on behalf of the Windshapers. Winds guide you, $N.]'),
(95350,'zhTW','[Welcome to Azeroth]','[Travel to Orgrimmar and speak with Thrall in the Valley of Wisdom.]','[It''s a big world down here, and our new allies are the key to our survival. The Earthen Ring is a member of the "Horde", a proud collection of like-minded peoples. The nearby city of Thunder Bluff is a part of the Horde, and further to the east lies the capital of Orgrimmar. Seek out the flight master in the center of Thunder Bluff. They will fly you to Orgrimmar where you will make contact with the Horde warchief--Thrall, on behalf of the Windshapers. Winds guide you, $N.]'),
(95494,'deDE','Verletzter Stolz und Löwenbalg','Sammelt 6 Savannenlöwenbälge von den Savannenmatriarchinnen und Savannenpartiarchen im Brachland.','Ich brauche jemanden mit einem starken Schwertarm und freier Zeit, um mir bei der Beschaffung einiger Löwenfelle zu helfen. Es kratzt an meinem Stolz, einen Fremden um Unterstützung zu bitten, aber ich habe mich vor Kurzem am Bein verletzt. Bis es verheilt ist, bin ich nicht in der Verfassung, selbst jagen zu gehen. Aber ich habe Verpflichtungen einzuhalten. Die Großen hier in der Gegend haben für gewöhnlich die besten Bälge, fangt also mit denen an.'),
(95494,'esES','Orgullo herido y pieles de león','Consigue 6 pieles de león de la sabana de las matriarcas y los patriarcas de la sabana en Los Baldíos.','Necesito a alguien con buen brazo para la espada y algo de tiempo libre que me ayude a reunir unas cuantas pieles de león. Me duele en el orgullo tener que pedirle este favor a alguien que no conozco, pero hace poco me hice una herida en la pierna. No estoy en condiciones de salir a cazar hasta que me recupere, pero tengo obligaciones que debo cumplir. Los leones grandes que hay en esta zona suelen tener las mejores pieles, así que empieza por ellos.'),
(95494,'esMX','El orgullo herido y la piel del león','Reúne 6 pieles de león de las matriarcas de la sabana y los patriarcas de la sabana en los Baldíos.','Necesito a alguien que sepa empuñar bien una espada y tenga algo de tiempo de sobra para ayudarme a reunir pieles de león. Me duele en el orgullo pedirle esto a $Gun forastero:una forastera;, pero hace poco me lastimé la pierna. Hasta que me recupere, no estoy en condiciones de salir a cazar, pero tengo obligaciones que cumplir. Los grandes de esta zona suelen tener las mejores pieles, así que empieza por esos.'),
(95494,'frFR','Fierté meurtrie et peaux de lion','Récupérez 6 peaux de lion des savanes sur les matriarches des savanes et les patriarches des savanes dans les Tarides.','J’ai besoin d’une personne au bras puissant et d’un peu de temps devant elle pour m’aider à rassembler des peaux de lion. Ma fierté en prend un coup du fait de demander son aide à $Gun étranger:une étrangère;, mais j’ai reçu une blessure à la jambe récemment. Jusqu’à mon rétablissement, je ne suis pas en état d’aller chasser moi-même, mais j’ai des obligations à tenir. Les gros spécimens de la région ont généralement les meilleures peaux, alors commencez par eux.'),
(95494,'itIT','[Bruised Pride and Lion Hides]','[Collect 6 Savannah Lion Hides from the Savannah Matriarchs and Savannah Patriarchs in the Barrens.]','[I need someone with a strong sword arm and some extra time on their hands to help me gather some lion hides. It stings my pride to ask a stranger for this aid, but I took an injury to my leg recently. Until I heal, I''m in no shape to go hunting myself but I have obligations to keep. The big ones in this area generally have the best hides, so start with those first.]'),
(95494,'koKR','상처 입은 자존심과 사자 가죽','불모의 땅에 있는 우두머리 사바나 암사자와 우두머리 사바나 사자에게서 사바나 사자 가죽 6개를 채취해야 합니다.','사자 가죽을 모으려면 칼을 좀 다룰 줄 알고 시간도 남는 사람이 필요하네. 이방인에게 이런 도움을 청하려니 자존심이 상하지만, 얼마 전 다리를 다쳐서 말이야. 나을 때까지 직접 사냥에 나갈 처지는 못 돼도 약속은 지켜야 하지 않겠나. 이 지역에서는 몸집이 큰 놈들의 가죽이 대개 가장 좋은 편이니, 그런 놈들부터 노리게.'),
(95494,'ptBR','Perna e orgulho feridos','Colete 6 Pelegos de Leão da Savana de Matriarcas da Savana e Patriarcas da Savana nos Sertões.','Seria ótimo se aparecesse alguém com uma espada afiada e tempo de sobra para me ajudar a pegar pelegos de leão. Fere o meu orgulho pedir esse favor a $Gum estranho:uma estranha;, mas machuquei a perna há pouco tempo. Estou impossibilitado de caçar até sarar, mas as obrigações não param. Os leões maiores da região são os que rendem os melhores pelegos, então comece por eles.'),
(95494,'ruRU','Уязвленная гордость и львиные шкуры','Добудьте 6 шкур равнинного льва у матриархов и патриархов саванны в Степях.','Мне нужен кто-нибудь с прямыми руками и свободным временем, чтобы раздобыть несколько львиных шкур. Стыдно просить об этом постороннего, но меня ранили в ногу совсем недавно. Пока что я не в состоянии идти на охоту, но обязанности никуда не денутся. Лучшие шкуры бывают у зверей покрупнее, так что начни с них.'),
(95494,'zhCN','受挫的自尊与狮皮','从贫瘠之地的草原狮后和草原狮王身上收集6张草原狮的皮。','我需要一个臂力过人且闲暇充裕的人，来帮我收集一些狮皮。向陌生人求助着实有伤自尊，可我最近伤了腿。在痊愈之前，我没法亲自去狩猎，但我还有必须要履行的约定。 这片区域里体型较大的通常皮毛最好，所以请先从它们下手吧。'),
(95494,'zhTW','[Bruised Pride and Lion Hides]','[Collect 6 Savannah Lion Hides from the Savannah Matriarchs and Savannah Patriarchs in the Barrens.]','[I need someone with a strong sword arm and some extra time on their hands to help me gather some lion hides. It stings my pride to ask a stranger for this aid, but I took an injury to my leg recently. Until I heal, I''m in no shape to go hunting myself but I have obligations to keep. The big ones in this area generally have the best hides, so start with those first.]'),
(95495,'deDE','Der einsiedlerische Kürschner','Bringt das Bündel Bälge dem Einsiedler auf dem Bergkamm über den Trockenen Hügeln im Brachland.','Diese Bälge sind für einen Kürschner, mit dem ich regelmäßig Handel treibe. Er ist ein ziemlicher Einsiedler und lebt allein auf dem Bergkamm hinter mir. Ich bin gerade nicht in der Verfassung, einen steilen Hang zu erklimmen, ich würde also tief in Eurer Schuld stehen, wenn Ihr diese Lieferung für mich übernehmen könntet. Oh, und wegen des... Aussehens dieses Kürschners. Ihr müsst Euch keine Sorgen machen. Er mag fies aussehen, aber er ist keine Bedrohung. Ich schwöre.'),
(95495,'esES','El peletero ermitaño','Llévale el fardo de pellejos al ermitaño que está en la cresta que domina Las Colinas Áridas, en Los Baldíos.','Estas pieles son para un peletero con el que suelo comerciar. Es un tanto ermitaño y vive solo en lo alto de la cresta que tengo a mi espalda. Ahora mismo no soy capaz de subir una ladera tan empinada, así que te estaría muy agradecido si pudieras hacer esta entrega por mí. Ah, y en cuanto al... aspecto del peletero, no te alarmes. A pesar de su apariencia, no supone ninguna amenaza. Te lo aseguro.'),
(95495,'esMX','El peletero ermitaño','Llévale el fardo de pieles al ermitaño que está en el risco con vista a las Colinas Áridas, en los Baldíos.','Estas pieles son para un peletero con el que comercio seguido. Es algo así como un ermitaño; vive solo en la cima del risco que tengo a mis espaldas. Ahora mismo, subir una ladera empinada no es algo que pueda hacer con facilidad, así que te debería una si pudieras hacer la entrega por mí. Ah, y sobre la... apariencia del peletero. No te asustes. A pesar de cómo se ve, no es una amenaza. Te lo juro.'),
(95495,'frFR','L’ermite tanneur','Apportez le tas de peaux à l’ermite vivant sur la crête qui surplombe les collines Arides dans les Tarides.','Ces peaux sont pour un tanneur avec lequel je commerce souvent. C’est une sorte d’ermite qui vit seul en haut de la crête derrière moi. Je ne peux vraiment gravir une colline pentue à l’heure actuelle, alors je vous serais redevable si vous pouviez livrer ces peaux pour moi. Oh, et concernant… l’apparence de ce tanneur. Ne vous inquiétez pas. Malgré son aspect, il n’est pas une menace. Je vous jure que c’est vrai.'),
(95495,'itIT','[The Hermit Tanner]','[Bring the Bundle of Hides to the hermit on the ridge overlooking the Dry Hills in the Barrens.]','[These hides are bound for a tanner who I often trade with. He is something of a hermit and he lives alone on the top of the ridge behind me. Climbing up a steep hillside isn''t something I can manage easily right now so I''d be in your debt if you could make this delivery for me. Oh, and about this tanner''s... appearance. You need not be alarmed. In spite of his looks, he is no threat. I swear this is true.]'),
(95495,'koKR','은둔자 무두장이','가죽 묶음을 불모의 땅 메마른 언덕이 내려다보이는 산등성이에 있는 은둔자에게 가져가야 합니다.','이 가죽은 내가 자주 거래하는 무두장이에게 보낼 물건이네. 좀 은둔자 같은 사람이라 뒤로 보이는 산등성이 꼭대기에서 홀로 살고 있네. 지금은 내가 가파른 비탈을 오르기가 쉽지 않은 상태라서, 자네가 대신 전해 준다면 신세를 지는 걸로 치지. 아, 그리고 그 무두장이의... 생김새 말인데. 놀랄 필요 없네. 겉보기와 달리 위험한 사람은 아니야. 내가 보증하지.'),
(95495,'ptBR','O curtumeiro ermitão','Leve o Pacote de Peles para o eremita no cume com vista para os Montes Áridos, nos Sertões.','Essas peles são para um curtumeiro com quem sempre faço negócios. Ele é meio ermitão, mora isolado no cume ali atrás de mim. Não estou em condições de escalar encostas íngremes agora, então vou ficar devendo um favor se você fizer essa entrega para mim. Ah, e quanto à... aparência do curtumeiro, não se assuste. O aspecto dele espanta, mas ele não faz mal a uma mosca. Dou a minha palavra.'),
(95495,'ruRU','Дубильщик-отшельник','Отнесите связку шкур отшельнику на гряду над Сухими холмами в Степях.','Эти шкуры предназначены для дубильщика, с которым я часто веду торговлю. Он что-то вроде отшельника и живет один на гряде позади меня. Сейчас мне будет трудновато туда подняться, так что буду признателен, если доставишь товар. Ах да, и насчет его... внешности. Не беспокойся, он совершенно безобиден. Клянусь, это так.'),
(95495,'zhCN','隐居的制皮匠','将一捆兽皮交给贫瘠之地无水岭上方山脊上的隐士。','这些毛皮要送给一个常与我交易的制皮匠。他算是半个隐士，独自住在我身后山脊的顶端。如今爬那陡坡对我来说实属不易，所以如果你能替我跑这一趟，我就欠你个人情。 哦，另外关于那制皮匠的……长相。你不必惊慌。尽管他容貌骇人，却没有任何威胁。我发誓千真万确。'),
(95495,'zhTW','隱居的製皮匠','帶著獸皮去貧瘠之地，然後交給住在能俯瞰無水嶺的山脊上的隱士。','這些皮革要交給一個我很常交易的製皮匠。他算是個隱士，就隻身住在我身後的山脊上。我可沒辦法爬上那陡坡，如果你能幫我把東西交給他，就算幫我一個大忙了。 噢，關於這個製皮匠的…長相。你不要被嚇到了。他雖然長相駭人，卻很友善。我發誓我說的是真的。'),
(95507,'deDE','Vrangs Spiel','Sammelt 8 gefangene Wildtiere aus den ausgelösten Fallen im Brachland.','Es wäre großartig, wenn Ihr mir helfen könntet, meine Fallen zu überprüfen, während Ihr da draußen unterwegs seid. Ich habe sie überall im Tal verteilt. Bringt mir jedes Kleinwild, das ich gefangen habe. Haltet aber die Augen nach anderen Wildtieren offen. Diese Gegend kann gefährlich sein, wenn man nicht aufpasst.'),
(95507,'esES','Las presas de Vrang','Recoge 8 presas de caza atrapadas en las trampas que hay en Los Baldíos.','Como vas a salir, me harías un gran favor si revisaras mis trampas. Las tengo repartidas por todo el valle. Tráeme cualquier presa de caza pequeña que encuentres en ellas. Ahora bien, no pierdas de vista al resto de la fauna. Esta zona puede ser peligrosa si bajas la guardia.'),
(95507,'esMX','Las presas de Vrang','Reúne 8 presas atrapadas de las trampas activadas en los Baldíos.','Ya que vas a estar por ahí, me harías un gran favor si pudieras revisar mis trampas. Las tengo desparramadas por todo el valle. Tráeme los animales pequeños que haya atrapado. Eso sí, no pierdas de vista a la otra vida silvestre de la zona. Puede ser peligroso si no prestas atención.'),
(95507,'frFR','Le gibier de Vrang','Récupérez 8 gibiers piégés dans les pièges déclenchés un peu partout dans les Tarides.','Tant que vous êtes là-bas, ça m’aiderait beaucoup si vous pouviez relever mes pièges. J’en ai installé un peu partout dans la vallée. Rapportez-moi tout le petit gibier que j’ai attrapé. Et gardez un œil sur les autres animaux d’ailleurs. Le secteur peut être dangereux si on ne fait pas attention.'),
(95507,'itIT','[Vrang''s Game]','[Collect 8 Trapped Game from traps found in Sprung Traps in the Barrens.]','[While you are out there, it would be of great help to me if you could check on my traps for me. I''ve got them strewn all over the valley. Bring back any small game that I''ve caught. Keep your eye out for the other wildlife, though. This area can be dangerous if you aren''t paying attention.]'),
(95507,'koKR','브랑의 사냥감','불모의 땅에 놓인 용수철 덫에서 덫에 걸린 사냥감 8마리를 모아야 합니다.','이왕 나가는 김에 내가 깔아놓은 덫들도 한번 살펴봐 주면 큰 도움이 되겠어. 골짜기 곳곳에 설치해 뒀네. 작은 사냥감이 잡혔으면 가져오게. 다만 다른 야생동물도 조심해야 할 거야. 까딱 방심했다가는 위험해지는 곳이거든.'),
(95507,'ptBR','A caça de Vrang','Colete 8 Caças Encurraladas achadas em Armadilhas Disparadas nos Sertões.','Se puder aproveitar as suas andanças para conferir as minhas armadilhas, vou ficar muito grato. Elas estão espalhadas por todo o vale. Traga de volta os animais de pequeno porte apanhados. Mas tome cuidado com outros animais selvagens. Essa área é perigosa para quem é descuidado.'),
(95507,'ruRU','Добыча Вранга','Соберите пойманную добычу из 8 сработавших ловушек в Степях.','А еще ты мне очень поможешь, если проверишь мои ловушки. Она расставлены по всей долине. Принеси любую мелкую дичь, которая в них попалась. Только смотри, чтобы какой зверь не напал на тебя. В этих краях лучше не отвлекаться.'),
(95507,'zhCN','弗朗恩的猎物','从贫瘠之地的爆炸陷阱中收集8份被困的猎物。','既然你在外头，要是能顺道帮我查查陷阱，可就算帮了大忙了。我把陷阱布满了整座山谷。 把夹住的小猎物都带回来。不过也要留神周围的其他野兽。要是掉以轻心，这地方可是很危险的。'),
(95507,'zhTW','[Vrang''s Game]','[Collect 8 Trapped Game from traps found in Sprung Traps in the Barrens.]','[While you are out there, it would be of great help to me if you could check on my traps for me. I''ve got them strewn all over the valley. Bring back any small game that I''ve caught. Keep your eye out for the other wildlife, though. This area can be dangerous if you aren''t paying attention.]'),
(95664,'deDE','Wissen der Ältesten','Bringt das Relikt der Titanen zur Anhöhe der Ältesten in Thunder Bluff und haltet Ausschau nach jemandem, der Euch mehr darüber erzählen kann.','Dieser ungewöhnlich zusammengesetzte Splitter streut das Licht wie ein lebendiges Prisma. Seine Herkunft ist ungewiss, doch seine Kraft scheint uralt zu sein. Die größten Experten für Artefakte aus diesem längst vergangenen Zeitalter müssen auf der Anhöhe der Ältesten in Thunder Bluff zu finden sein.'),
(95664,'esES','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95664,'esMX','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95664,'frFR','Le savoir des anciens','Apportez la relique des Titans à la cime des Anciens, aux Pitons-du-Tonnerre, et cherchez quelqu’un qui saura vous en apprendre davantage à son sujet.','Cet étrange éclat composite diffracte la lumière tel un prisme vivant. Sa nature demeure incertaine, mais son pouvoir semble ancien. S’il existe encore des érudits capables de percer les secrets d’un artéfact d’une époque aussi lointaine, vous les trouverez sans doute à la cime des Anciens, aux Pitons-du-Tonnerre.'),
(95664,'itIT','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95664,'koKR','장로의 지식','티탄의 유물을 썬더 블러프의 장로의 봉우리로 가져가서 자세한 이야기를 해 줄 만한 사람을 찾아야 합니다.','이 특이한 복합 파편은 살아 있는 분광경처럼 빛을 흩뿌립니다. 정체는 알 수 없지만 아주 오래된 힘이 느껴집니다. 지난 시대의 유물에 대해 가장 잘 아는 이들은 썬더 블러프의 장로의 봉우리에 있을 것입니다.'),
(95664,'ptBR','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95664,'ruRU','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95664,'zhCN','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95664,'zhTW','[Elder Knowledge]','[Take the Titan Relic to the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff and look for someone who can tell you more about it.]','[This unusual composite shard scatters light like a living prism. Its nature is uncertain, but its power feels ancient. The most knowledgeable minds for artifacts of this bygone age must reside on the Elder rise in Thunder Bluff.]'),
(95774,'deDE','Ihr Name ist Olgra','Erschlagt Stacheleber und sammelt 4 von Olgras Schmuckstücken für Mankriks Denkmal.','Der Heiler, der mich gerettet hat, konnte für Olgra nichts mehr tun. Sie ist im Kampf gefallen. Ich werde sie niemals vergessen. Habt Ihr ihren Schmuck nicht bei ihr gefunden? Sie trug viele kunstvoll gearbeitete Knochenornamente. Erschlagt die Räuber der Grimmhauer in dem Gebiet, wo Olgra gestorben ist, und bringt mir ihre kostbaren Schmuckstücke! Ich möchte sie an dem Denkmal niederlegen, das ich für Olgra errichte.'),
(95774,'esES','Se llama Olgra','Mata jabaespines y reúne de los adornos de Olgra para el monumento de Mankrik.','La sanadora que me salvó no pudo salvarla a ella, y ha muerto en combate. Se llamaba Olgra, y nunca la olvidaré. ¿No viste sus adornos en su cuerpo? Llevaba numerosas joyas de hueso pulido. ¡Mata a los asaltantes Crines de Acero en el lugar donde murió y recupera sus preciadas obras de arte! Las colocaré en el monumento que he construido en su memoria.'),
(95774,'esMX','Su nombre es Olgra','Mata jabaespines y consigue 4 de los adornos de Olgra para el monumento de Mankrik.','El sanador que me salvó a mí no pudo salvarla a ella, y murió en combate. Su nombre es Olgra, y jamás la olvidaré. ¿No encontraste los adornos en su cuerpo? Llevaba muchas joyas de hueso pulido. Mata a los asaltantes Crines de Acero que encuentres cerca del lugar donde cayó y recupera sus preciadas obras de arte. Las colocaré en el monumento que construiré para honrar su memoria.'),
(95774,'frFR','Son nom est Olgra','Tuez des Hurans et récupérez 4 parures d’Olgra pour le mémorial de Mankrik.','La soigneuse qui m’a guéri n’a pas pu la sauver, et elle est morte au combat. Son nom est Olgra, et je ne l’oublierai jamais. Avez-vous retrouvé ses parures sur son corps ? Elle portait de nombreux bijoux en os poli. Éliminez les pillards tranchecrin près de l’endroit où elle a trouvé la mort, et retrouvez ses précieuses œuvres d’art ! Je les déposerai près du mémorial que j’érige en sa mémoire.'),
(95774,'itIT','[Her Name Is Olgra]','[Slay quilboars and collect 4 of Olgra''s Adornments for Mankrik''s memorial.]','[The healer who saved me could not save her, and she has died in battle. Her name is Olgra, and I will never forget her. You did not find her adornments on her body? She wore many jewels of polished bone. Slay the Razormane Raiders near where she fell, and find her precious works of art! I will place them with the memorial that I build in her memory.]'),
(95774,'koKR','그 이름은 올그라','가시멧돼지를 처치하고 만크릭의 추모비에 바칠 올그라의 장식 4개를 모아야 합니다.','나를 살린 치유사도 올그라까지 구하지는 못했네. 내 아내 올그라는 전투에서 죽었고, 나는 그 이름을 절대 잊지 않을 걸세. 시신에서 장식품을 찾지 못했다고? 올그라는 윤이 나게 다듬은 뼈 장신구를 많이 지니고 있었네. 올그라가 쓰러진 곳 근처의 서슬갈기일족 약탈자를 처치하고 아내의 소중한 장식품을 되찾아 오게! 올그라를 기리며 세울 추모비에 함께 두겠네.'),
(95774,'ptBR','O nome dela era Olgra','Mate javatuscos e pegue 4 dos Adornos de Olgra para o memorial de Mankrik.','O curandeiro que me salvou não conseguir salvá-la, e ela morreu em combate. O nome dela era Olgra, e eu nunca vou esquecê-la. Você não encontrou os adornos no corpo dela? Ela vestia muitas joias de ossos polidos. Acabe com os Saqueadores Crinavalha perto de onde ela se foi, e encontre as obras de arte dela! Vou colocá-las no memorial que construí para ela.'),
(95774,'ruRU','Ее зовут Ольгра','Добудьте у свинобразов 4 |4украшение Ольгры:украшения Ольгры:украшений Ольгры; для памятника и принесите Манкрику.','Лекарю удалось спасти меня, но не ее. Она погибла в бою. Ее имя – Ольгра, и я никогда ее не забуду. На ней не было украшений? Она носила много вещей из полированной кости. Убей налетчиков из племени Иглогривых возле того места, где она погибла, и найди ее драгоценные украшения! Я размещу их на памятнике, который воздвигну в память о ней.'),
(95774,'zhCN','她的名字叫奥格拉','消灭野猪人，为曼科里克的纪念碑收集4件奥格拉的饰物。','救下我的治疗者没能救活她，她已经在战斗中阵亡。她叫奥格拉，我永远都不会忘记她。 你没有在她的遗体上找到她的饰品吗？她曾戴着许多由抛光白骨制成的首饰。 去她倒下的地方附近，杀掉那些钢鬃掠夺者，找回她珍视的艺术品！ 我会把它们安放在为她建造的纪念碑上，以此缅怀。'),
(95774,'zhTW','她名叫奧格菈','殺死野豬人，然後為曼寇里克的紀念碑收集4個奧格菈飾物。','救我一命的治療者沒辦法救她，所以她就這樣戰死了。她叫奧格菈，我至死都不會忘記她。 你沒有在她的遺體上找到她的飾物嗎？她生前戴了許多打磨過的骨頭。 殺死她陣亡之處附近的剃鬃劫掠者，然後找到她生前的傑作！ 我會把它們放在為她建造的紀念碑上來緬懷她。'),
(95981,'deDE','Straßensperre','Tötet 8 Hexer von Dalaran und 8 Behüter von Dalaran für Schattenpriester Allister am Grabmal.','Ihnen die Amulette wegzunehmen, ist nur der erste Schritt. Wenn die Kirin Tor tatsächlich regelmäßig Relikte aus Dalaran liefern, müssen wir sie an der Quelle stoppen. Sucht die Straßen rund um Ambermill nach den Zauberern und Wächtern von Dalaran ab. Ihre Anwesenheit hat viel zu lange den offenen Zugang über unsere Grenzen hinweg ermöglicht. Wenn wir vermögen, ihre Zahl zu verringern, sollte das verhindern, dass diese Anhänger überhaupt erst in den Silberwald gelangen.'),
(95981,'esES','Vigilar los caminos','Mata a 8 zahoríes de Dalaran y a 8 vigilantes de Dalaran para el sacerdote de las Sombras Allister en El Sepulcro.','Quitarles sus colgantes solo es el primer paso. Si de verdad los Kirin Tor han establecido un suministro estable de reliquias desde Dalaran, debemos cortarlo de raíz. Inspecciona los caminos alrededor de Molino Ámbar en busca de zahoríes y vigilantes de Dalaran. Su presencia lleva demasiado tiempo permitiendo el libre acceso a nuestras fronteras. Si logramos mermar sus filas, al menos podremos evitar que esos colgantes lleguen al Bosque de Argénteos para empezar.'),
(95981,'esMX','Caminos vigilados','Mata a 8 magos de Dalaran y 8 vigías de Dalaran para el sacerdote de las Sombras Allister en El Sepulcro.','Llevarnos sus pendientes fue tan solo el primer paso. Si es verdad que el Kirin Tor está enviando un flujo constante de reliquias desde Dalaran, debemos detenerlos en el punto de origen. Recorre los caminos en las inmediaciones de Molino Ámbar en busca de magos y vigías de Dalaran. Su presencia ha permitido el libre acceso por nuestras fronteras desde hace mucho tiempo. Si podemos reducir sus filas, eso debería bastar para que los colgantes dejen de llegar al Bosque de Argénteos en primer lugar.'),
(95981,'frFR','Routes sous surveillance','Tuez 8 sorciers de Dalaran et 8 guetteurs de Dalaran pour le prêtre des ombres Allister au Sépulcre.','Confisquer leurs pendentifs n’est que la première étape. Si le Kirin Tor envoie réellement un flux constant de reliques depuis Dalaran, nous devons les arrêter à la source. Cherchez des sorciers et des guetteurs de Dalaran sur les routes près du Moulin-de-l’Ambre. Le libre passage qu’ils imposent à nos frontières n’a que trop duré. Si nous parvenons à réduire leur nombre, la forêt des Pins-Argentés ne devrait plus recevoir de pendentifs.'),
(95981,'itIT','[Watching the Roads]','[Slay 8 Dalaran Wizards and 8 Dalaran Watchers for Shadow Priest Allister in the Sepulcher.]','[Taking away their pendants is just the first step. If the Kirin Tor really are shipping a steady supply of relics from Dalaran, we must stop them at the source. Search the roads around Ambermill for Dalaran''s wizards and watchers. Their presence has allowed free access across our borders for too long. If we can cull their numbers, that should put a stop to these pendants making it into Silverpine Forest in the first place.]'),
(95981,'koKR','길목의 파수꾼','공동묘지에 있는 어둠의 사제 알리스터를 위해 달라란 마술사 8명과 달라란 파수꾼 8명을 처치해야 합니다.','놈들의 펜던트를 빼앗는 건 첫걸음일 뿐이네. 키린 토가 정말 달라란에서 유물을 끊임없이 실어 나르는 거라면 근원부터 차단해야 하네. 앰버밀 주변 길목에서 달라란 마술사와 감시자를 찾아보게. 놈들이 우리 국경을 제집처럼 드나든 지 너무 오래됐네. 그 수를 줄이면 펜던트가 아예 은빛소나무 숲으로 들어오지 못하게 할 수 있을 걸세.'),
(95981,'ptBR','De olho nas estradas','Abata 8 Teurgos de Dalaran e 8 Vigias de Dalaran para o Sacerdote Sombrio Allister no Sepulcro.','Tomar os pingentes deles é só o primeiro passo. Se o Kirin Tor está mesmo enviando um fornecimento regular de relíquias de Dalaran, precisamos detê-los na fonte. Procure por vigias e teurgos de Dalaran nas estradas ao redor de Lenhâmbar. Sua presença permitiu que cruzassem nossas fronteiras livremente por muito tempo. Se conseguirmos reduzir seus números, creio que vamos impedir até mesmo que os pingentes cheguem à Floresta de Pinhaprata.'),
(95981,'ruRU','Наблюдение за дорогами','Убейте 8 |4даларанского волшебника:даларанских волшебников:даларанских волшебников; и 8 |4даларанского дозорного:даларанских дозорных:даларанских дозорных; по приказу жреца Тьма Аллистера, который находится в Гробнице.','Отобрать подвески – лишь первый шаг. Если Кирин-Тор действительно организовал постоянные поставки реликвий из Даларана, необходимо устранить их источник. Осмотри дороги у Янтарной мельницы и отыщи там даларанских волшебников и дозорных. Слишком долго мы разрешали им пересекать наши границы. Если избавиться от них, то подвесок в Серебряном бору больше не станет.'),
(95981,'zhCN','监视道路','为瑟伯切尔的暗影牧师奥利斯特杀死8名达拉然巫师和8名达拉然卫士。','夺走他们的坠饰只是第一步。如果肯瑞托真在不断从达拉然运出圣物，我们就必须从源头截断这条路线。 去安伯米尔周围的道路上搜寻达拉然巫师和卫士。这些人长久以来一直在我们的边境通行无阻。只要削减他们的人手，也许就能阻止这些坠饰继续流入银松森林。'),
(95981,'zhTW','監視道路','為瑟伯切爾的暗影牧師奧利斯特殺死8個達拉然巫師和8個達拉然衛士。','拿走他們的墜飾只是第一步。如果祈倫托真的從達拉然送出穩定供應的聖物，我們必須從源頭阻止他們。 搜索安伯米爾周圍的道路，尋找達拉然的巫師和衛士。因為他們的存在，我們的邊界一直以來都形同虛設。如果我們可以削減他們的數量，應該就能順利防止這些墜飾流入銀松森林。'),
(95998,'deDE','Die große weite Welt','Setzt Euch an Sams einfaches Lagerfeuer, indem Ihr /sitzen ins Chatfenster eingebt, und wartet, bis Ihr den verbesserten Ruhebonus erhalten habt.','Hallöchen, $C. Ich sehe, dass Ihr den Geist des Abenteuers in Euch tragt. Schön für Euch. Die Welt braucht mehr rastlose Seelen wie uns, die nach Ruhm und Reichtum streben. Es ist eine große weite Welt da draußen und Ihr werdet lernen müssen, Euch in der Wildnis wohlzufühlen, wenn Ihr erfolgreich sein wollt. Ich weiß nicht, wie es um Eure Überlebenskünste bestellt ist, aber ich kann Euch vermutlich das eine oder andere beibringen, wenn Ihr gewillt seid, zu lernen. Setzt Euch neben das Feuer, macht es Euch gemütlich. Ich werde Euch alles erklären.'),
(95998,'esES','El gran mundo exterior','Escribe /sentarse en el chat junto a la hoguera básica de Sam y espera hasta recibir el beneficio Descanso mejorado.','Qué hay, $C. Tienes el aspecto de alguien que ama la aventura. Me alegro por ti. El mundo necesita más espíritus inquietos como los nuestros, siempre en busca de fortuna y gloria. Esta tierra es enorme, y tendrás que aprender a valerte por ti $Gmismo:misma; en la naturaleza si quieres salir $Gairoso:airosa;. No sé cómo te las apañas al aire libre, pero probablemente pueda enseñarte un par de cosas. Ven, acomódate junto al fuego y te lo explicaré todo.'),
(95998,'esMX','Bendita naturaleza','Siéntate cerca de la hoguera básica de Sam, escribe /sentarse en la ventana de chat y espera hasta que recibas el beneficio Descanso mejorado.','Saludos, $C. Veo que tienes aspecto de $Gaventurero:aventurera;. ¡Qué bien! El mundo necesita más almas inquietas como nosotros, en busca de fortuna y gloria. El mundo es enorme, y necesitarás aprender a sobrevivir en la naturaleza para alcanzar tus metas. No conozco tus habilidades al aire libre, pero apuesto a que podría enseñarte un par de cosas, si estás $Gdispuesto:dispuesta; a aprender. Siéntate cerca del fuego y ponte $Gcómodo:cómoda;. Te lo explicaré todo.'),
(95998,'frFR','Les grands espaces sauvages','Asseyez-vous près du feu de camp basique de Sam en tapant /assis dans la fenêtre de discussion et attendez de recevoir l’amélioration Repos amplifié.','Bien le bonjour, $C. Vous, vous aimez l’aventure, ça se voit comme le nez au milieu de la figure. Tant mieux ! Le monde a besoin de plus d’âmes vagabondes qui partent en quête de gloire et de fortune. Mais pour survivre dans ce vaste monde, vous allez devoir apprendre à vivre en milieu sauvage. J’ignore à quel point vous êtes à l’aise en extérieur, mais je peux sans doute vous enseigner une astuce ou deux, si ça vous dit. Installez-vous près du feu, mettez-vous à l’aise. Je vais vous expliquer les bases.'),
(95998,'itIT','[The Great Outdoors]','[Sit near Sam''s Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff.]','[Well howdy there, $C. I can see you''ve got the look of an adventurer about you. Good for you. The world needs more of us restless souls, seeking fortune and glory. It''s a big wide world out there and you''ll need to learn to thrive in the wilds to be successful. Not sure how your outdoorsman skills are but I reckon I could teach you a thing or two, if you''d be apt to learn. Have a seat near the fire, get comfy. I''ll walk you through it.]'),
(95998,'koKR','드넓은 야외','대화창에 /앉기를 입력해 샘의 작은 모닥불 주위에 앉은 다음, "휴식 강화" 강화 효과를 받을 때까지 기다려야 합니다.','어서 오세요, $C님. 딱 모험가의 눈빛이군요. 좋습니다. 세상에는 부와 영광을 찾아 나서는 우리 같은 방랑자가 더 많아져야 하거든요. 세상은 넓고 광활합니다. 요컨대 잘 먹고 잘 살려면 야생에서 버티는 법부터 익혀야 합니다. 야외 생활에 얼마나 익숙한지는 모르겠지만, 배울 마음만 있다면 제가 몇 가지는 알려 드릴 수 있습니다. 불가에 앉아 편히 쉬세요. 차근차근 알려 드리겠습니다.'),
(95998,'ptBR','Vida ao ar livre','Sente-se perto da Fogueira Básica de Sam digitando /sentar na janela de bate-papo e espere até receber um bônus de Descanso Melhorado.','Opa, tudo bem, $C? Tô vendo que você tem jeitão de $Gaventureiro:aventureira;. Aí sim. O mundo precisa de mais almas inquietas como a gente, atrás de glória e fortuna. O mundo é imenso, e você vai ter que aprender a se virar no mato pra se dar bem. Não sei como são as suas habilidades campeiras, mas garanto que posso te ensinar uma coisa ou outra, se estiver a fim de aprender. Puxa um banco aí perto do fogo, fica à vontade. Vou te mostrar como é.'),
(95998,'ruRU','Дикие просторы','Сядьте у костра Сэма, набрав /сесть в окне чата, и дождитесь получения усиления "Улучшенный отдых".','Приветствую, |3-6($C). Ты, похоже, $Gодин:одна; из нас, искателей приключений. Славно, славно. Миру нужно больше таких неугомонных, как мы, – вечно ищущих богатство и славу. Мир вокруг очень велик, и нужно учиться быть в диких краях как дома, чтобы преуспеть в нашем деле. Не знаю, насколько ты уже в этом $Gподкован:подкована;, но если хочешь, могу научить тебя паре трюков. Сядь у костра, устраивайся поудобнее, и я тебе все расскажу.'),
(95998,'zhCN','广阔天地','在聊天窗口输入/sit（/坐下），坐在萨姆的基础营火旁，直到你获得“强化休息”增益。','嘿，你好啊，$C。我看得出你浑身上下透着股冒险者的气质。这很好。这个世界正需要更多像我们这样不安分的灵魂，去追寻财富与荣耀。 外面的世界很广阔，要想出人头地，你必须学会如何在荒野中生存。不知你的野外生存技巧如何，但只要你肯学，我想我能教你一两招。 在火堆旁找个位置坐下，放松点。我会一步一步教你。'),
(95998,'zhTW','戶外真好','坐在山姆的基礎營火旁（使用聊天指令/sit），然後等待獲得「加強休息」加成效果。','你好啊，$C。你看起來像個厲害的冒險者。這是好事。這個世界需要更多像我們不眠不休地追尋寶藏和榮譽的人。 外頭的世界很大，若要成為一名成功的冒險者，你就必須學會在野外生存的技能。不確定你知道多少生存技能，但如果你願意的話，我可以教你一兩招。 坐在火堆旁好好休息一下吧。我會好好告訴你的。'),
(96057,'deDE','Grundlagen des Zeltens: Schneiderei','Geht nach Ironforge und sprecht mit Urthar Threx, um zu lernen, wie Ihr einen Lagergegenstand für Euren Beruf herstellt, nachdem Ihr Euer Geschick in Eurer Fertigkeit unter Beweis gestellt habt.','Die Schneiderei ist eine überraschend effektive Handwerkskunst, und ich bin sicher, sie wird Euch einigen Nutzen bringen. Ich kenne da jemanden, der Euch zeigen kann, wie Ihr ein Fraktionsbanner für Euer Lager anfertigt, sofern Ihr die Fertigkeit dazu habt. Motivation und Kampfmoral sind enorm wichtig für den Erfolg auf dem Schlachtfeld, und ein inspirierendes Banner sorgt dafür, dass Ihr mit vollem Einsatz bei der Sache bleibt.'),
(96057,'esES','Acampada para novatos: sastrería','Habla con Uthrar Threx en Forjaz para aprender a crear un objeto de acampada para tu profesión cuando hayas demostrado tu destreza en la habilidad.','Sastrería es una habilidad comercial sorprendentemente útil en la que invertir, y no me cabe duda de que te será de gran utilidad. Creo recordar a alguien que puede enseñarte a crear un estandarte de facción para tu campamento si dispones de la habilidad necesaria. La inspiración y la moral son fundamentales para el éxito en cualquier campo de batalla, y un estandarte inspirador puede contribuir enormemente a mantener un buen ánimo.'),
(96057,'esMX','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Uthrar Threx in Ironforge to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96057,'frFR','Introduction au camping : la couture','Parlez à Uthrar Threx, à Forgefer, pour apprendre à fabriquer un objet de camping propre à votre métier une fois que vous vous serez fait la main.','La couture est un métier étonnamment utile, et je suis sûr qu’elle vous rendra de fiers services. Je connais quelqu’un qui peut vous apprendre à fabriquer une bannière de faction pour votre camp, pourvu que vous en ayez les compétences. L’inspiration et le moral sont essentiels sur un champ de bataille, et une bannière inspirante contribuera grandement à vous maintenir en pleine forme.'),
(96057,'itIT','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Uthrar Threx in Ironforge to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96057,'koKR','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Uthrar Threx in Ironforge to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96057,'ptBR','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Uthrar Threx in Ironforge to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96057,'ruRU','Основы походной жизни: портняжное дело','Поговорите с Утраром Трексом в Стальгорне, чтобы показать свои навыки и научиться создавать предмет для лагеря, соответствующий вашей профессии.','Портняжное дело – на удивление полезный навык, который, не сомневаюсь, будет часто тебя выручать. Я знаю кое-кого, кто может научить тебя создавать знамя фракции для лагеря. Если, конечно, ты достаточно $Gумел:умела; для этого. В любой битве боевой дух очень важен, и вдохновляющее знамя может его поднять.'),
(96057,'zhCN','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Uthrar Threx in Ironforge to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96057,'zhTW','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Uthrar Threx in Ironforge to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96101,'deDE','Die große weite Welt','Setzt Euch an Raans einfaches Lagerfeuer, indem Ihr /sitzen ins Chatfenster eingebt, und wartet, bis Ihr den verbesserten Ruhebonus erhalten habt.','Seid gegrüßt, $C. Ich sehe, dass Ihr den Geist des Abenteuers in Euch tragt. Das ist gut. Die Welt braucht mehr rastlose Seelen wie uns, die nach Ruhm und Reichtum streben. Ihr werdet lernen müssen, Euch in der Wildnis wohl zu fühlen, wenn Ihr erfolgreich sein wollt. Ich weiß nicht, wie es um Eure Überlebenskünste bestellt ist, aber ich kann Euch vermutlich das eine oder andere beibringen, wenn Ihr gewillt seid, zu lernen. Setzt Euch neben das Feuer und macht es Euch gemütlich. Ich werde Euch alles erklären.'),
(96101,'esES','El gran mundo exterior','Escribe /sentarse en el chat junto a la hoguera básica de Raan y espera hasta recibir el beneficio Descanso mejorado.','Hola, $C. Tienes el aspecto de alguien que ama la aventura. Me gusta. El mundo necesita más espíritus inquietos como los nuestros, siempre en busca de fortuna y gloria. Tendrás que aprender a valerte por ti $Gmismo:misma; en la naturaleza si quieres triunfar en este oficio. No sé cómo te las apañas al aire libre, pero probablemente pueda enseñarte un par de cosas. Ven, acomódate junto al fuego, yo te lo explicaré todo.'),
(96101,'esMX','[The Great Outdoors]','[Sit near Raan''s Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff.]','[Greetings, $C. I can see you''ve got the look of an adventurer about you. This is good. The world needs more of us restless souls, seeking fortune and glory. You''ll need to learn to thrive in the wilds to be successful in this line of work. Not sure how your outdoor skills are but I can probably teach you a thing or two, if you''d be apt to learn. Have a seat near the fire and get comfortable. I''ll walk you through it.]'),
(96101,'frFR','Les grands espaces sauvages','Asseyez-vous près du feu de camp basique de Raan en tapant /assis dans la fenêtre de discussion et attendez de recevoir l’amélioration Repos amplifié.','Bien le bonjour, $C. Vous, vous aimez l’aventure, ça se voit comme le nez au milieu de la figure. Tant mieux ! Le monde a besoin de plus d’âmes vagabondes qui partent en quête de gloire et de fortune. Mais pour en faire votre gagne-pain, vous allez devoir apprendre à vivre en milieu sauvage. J’ignore à quel point vous êtes à l’aise en extérieur, mais je peux probablement vous enseigner une astuce ou deux, si ça vous dit. Installez-vous près du feu, mettez-vous à l’aise. Je vais vous expliquer les bases.'),
(96101,'itIT','[The Great Outdoors]','[Sit near Raan''s Basic Campfire and wait until you receive the Boosted Rest buff.]','[Greetings, $C. I can see you''ve got the look of an adventurer about you. This is good. The world needs more of us restless souls, seeking fortune and glory. You''ll need to learn to thrive in the wilds to be successful in this line of work. Not sure how your outdoor skills are but I can probably teach you a thing or two, if you''d be apt to learn. Have a seat near the fire and get comfortable. I''ll walk you through it.]'),
(96101,'koKR','드넓은 야외','대화창에 /앉기를 입력해 란의 작은 모닥불 주위에 앉은 다음, "휴식 강화" 강화 효과를 받을 때까지 기다려야 합니다.','어서 오세요, $C님. 딱 모험가의 눈빛이군요. 좋습니다. 세상에는 부와 영광을 찾아 나서는 우리 같은 방랑자가 더 많아져야 하거든요. 이 일로 먹고살려면 야생에서 버티는 법부터 익혀야 합니다. 야외 생활에 얼마나 익숙한지는 모르겠지만, 배울 마음만 있다면 제가 몇 가지는 알려 드릴 수 있습니다. 불가에 앉아 편히 쉬세요. 차근차근 알려 드리겠습니다.'),
(96101,'ptBR','Vida ao ar livre','Sente-se perto da Fogueira Básica de Raan digitando /sentar na janela de bate-papo e espere até receber um bônus Descanso Melhorado.','Saudações, $C. Vejo que você tem a aparência de $Gaventureiro:aventureira;. Isso é bom. O mundo precisa de mais almas inquietas como nós, que buscam fortuna e glória. Você precisará aprender a prosperar na natureza se quiser ter sucesso neste tipo de trabalho. Não conheço suas habilidades ao ar livre, mas posso ensinar uma coisinha ou outra, se você puder aprender. Sente-se perto do fogo e fique à vontade. Vou explicar tudo.'),
(96101,'ruRU','Дикие просторы','Сядьте у костра Раана, набрав /сесть в окне чата, и дождитесь получения усиления "Улучшенный отдых".','Приветствую, |3-6($C). Ты, похоже, $Gодин:одна; из нас, искателей приключений. Это хорошо. Миру нужно больше таких неугомонных, как мы, – вечно ищущих богатство и славу. Чтобы преуспевать в этом деле, тебе нужно быть в диких краях как дома. Не знаю, насколько ты уже в этом $Gподкован:подкована;, но, возможно, смогу научить тебя паре трюков, если хочешь. Сядь у костра поудобнее. Я тебе все расскажу.'),
(96101,'zhCN','广阔天地','在聊天窗口中输入/sit（/坐下），坐在拉安的基础营火附近，直到获得“强化休息”增益。','你好，$C。我看得出你浑身上下透着股冒险者的气质。这很好。这世界正需要更多像我们这般渴求财富与荣耀的不羁灵魂。 想吃这碗饭，你得学会怎么在荒野中求生。不知道你的野外生存本事如何，但只要你肯学，我也许能教你两手。 在营火旁找个位置坐下，放松点。我会一步步教你的。'),
(96101,'zhTW','戶外真好','坐在拉恩的基礎營火旁（使用聊天指令/sit），然後等待獲得「加強休息」加成效果。','你好，$C。你看起來像個厲害的冒險者。太好了。這個世界需要更多像我們不眠不休地追尋寶藏和榮譽的人。 若要成為一名成功的冒險者，你就必須學會在野外生存的技能。不確定你知道多少，但如果你願意的話，我可以教你一兩招。 坐在火堆旁好好休息一下吧。我會好好告訴你的。'),
(96102,'deDE','Grundlagen des Zeltens: Schneiderei','Geht nach Orgrimmar und sprecht mit Snang, um zu lernen, wie Ihr einen Lagergegenstand für Euren Beruf herstellt, nachdem Ihr Euer Geschick in Eurer Fertigkeit unter Beweis gestellt habt.','Die Schneiderei ist eine überraschend effektive Handwerkskunst, und ich bin sicher, sie wird Euch einigen Nutzen bringen. Ich kenne da jemanden, der Euch zeigen kann, wie Ihr ein Fraktionsbanner für Euer Lager anfertigt, sofern Ihr die Fertigkeit dazu habt. Motivation und Kampfmoral sind enorm wichtig für den Erfolg auf dem Schlachtfeld, und ein inspirierendes Banner sorgt dafür, dass Ihr mit vollem Einsatz bei der Sache bleibt.'),
(96102,'esES','Acampada para novatos: sastrería','Habla con Snang en Orgrimmar para aprender a crear un objeto de acampada para tu profesión cuando hayas demostrado tu destreza en la habilidad.','Sastrería es una habilidad comercial sorprendentemente útil en la que invertir, y no me cabe duda de que te será de gran utilidad. Creo recordar a alguien que puede enseñarte a crear un estandarte de facción para tu campamento si dispones de la habilidad necesaria. La inspiración y la moral son fundamentales para el éxito en cualquier campo de batalla, y un estandarte inspirador puede contribuir enormemente a mantener un buen ánimo.'),
(96102,'esMX','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Snang in Orgrimmar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96102,'frFR','Introduction au camping : la couture','Parlez à Snang, à Orgrimmar, pour apprendre à fabriquer un objet de camping propre à votre métier une fois que vous vous serez fait la main.','La couture est un métier étonnamment utile, et je suis sûr qu’elle vous rendra de fiers services. Je connais quelqu’un qui peut vous apprendre à fabriquer une bannière de faction pour votre camp, pourvu que vous en ayez les compétences. L’inspiration et le moral sont essentiels sur un champ de bataille, et une bannière inspirante contribuera grandement à vous maintenir en pleine forme.'),
(96102,'itIT','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Snang in Orgrimmar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96102,'koKR','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Snang in Orgrimmar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96102,'ptBR','Introdução ao acampamento: Alfaiataria','Fale com Snang em Orgrimmar para aprender a criar um item de acampamento para a sua profissão quando demonstrar proficiência nessa perícia.','Pode te surpreender, mas a alfaiataria é um ofício muito potente para investir, e com certeza tem tudo a ver com você. Conheço alguém que pode lhe ensinar a criar um estandarte de facção para o seu acampamento, caso você tenha a perícia adequada. Inspiração e moral são cruciais para o sucesso em qualquer batalha, e um estandarte inspirador faz milagres quando se trata de deixar você com os ânimos lá em cima.'),
(96102,'ruRU','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Snang in Orgrimmar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96102,'zhCN','露营基础：裁缝','展示出你对专业技能的精通后，前往奥格瑞玛寻找斯诺恩，学习如何制作与你专业相符的露营物品。','裁缝是一门极其强大且值得投入的商业技能，我相信它一定会对你大有裨益。 我认识某个人，只要你的技能达标，他就能教你如何为营地制作阵营旗帜。鼓舞和士气是战场制胜的关键，而一面振奋人心的旗帜能在很大程度上让你保持斗志。'),
(96102,'zhTW','[Camping 101: Tailoring]','[Speak with Snang in Orgrimmar to learn to craft a camping item for your profession once you have shown proficiency in your skill.]','[Tailoring is a surprisingly potent tradeskill to invest in, and I''m sure it''ll serve you well. I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Faction Banner for your camp, provided you have the skill for it. Inspiration and morale are a key part of success on any battlefield, and an inspirational banner can go a long way to keeping you energized.]'),
(96241,'deDE','Giftgespräche','Benutzt den Toxinextraktor, um 5 Toxinproben der Düsteranhöhe von den angenagten Leichnamen auf der Düsteranhöhe zu sammeln.','Bei der Düsteranhöhe geht was Komisches vor sich. Der alte Mazu''kon hat so einiges über diese garstigen neuen Bestien gehört, die da überall rumkriechen. Manche sagen, diese Krabbelviecher haben ''n Gift mit ganz speziellen Eigenschaften, und das macht mich neugierig. Nehmt meinen Extraktor. Verwendet ihn bei den toten Körpern, die da überall rumliegen, um das Gift zu ernten. Tut das, und ich steh'' in Eurer Schuld.'),
(96241,'esES','[Talkin'' bout Toxins, Mon]','[Use the Toxin Extractor to gather 5 Gloomrise Toxin Samples from the Gnawed Corpses at Gloomrise.]','[Something funny be happenin'' over there at Gloomrise. Ol'' Mazu''kon be hearin all about these nasty new beasties skitterin'' all around there. Some say those creepy crawlies got a venom that have some unique properties and this be gettin'' me curious. Take my extractor. Use it on the dead bodies layin'' around that place to harvest the venom. Do this and I be in ya debt, mon.]'),
(96241,'esMX','[Talkin'' bout Toxins, Mon]','[Use the Toxin Extractor to gather 5 Gloomrise Toxin Samples from the Gnawed Corpses at Gloomrise.]','[Something funny be happenin'' over there at Gloomrise. Ol'' Mazu''kon be hearin all about these nasty new beasties skitterin'' all around there. Some say those creepy crawlies got a venom that have some unique properties and this be gettin'' me curious. Take my extractor. Use it on the dead bodies layin'' around that place to harvest the venom. Do this and I be in ya debt, mon.]'),
