(96241,'ptBR','[Talkin'' bout Toxins, Mon]','[Use the Toxin Extractor to gather 5 Gloomrise Toxin Samples from the Gnawed Corpses at Gloomrise.]','[Something funny be happenin'' over there at Gloomrise. Ol'' Mazu''kon be hearin all about these nasty new beasties skitterin'' all around there. Some say those creepy crawlies got a venom that have some unique properties and this be gettin'' me curious. Take my extractor. Use it on the dead bodies layin'' around that place to harvest the venom. Do this and I be in ya debt, mon.]'),
(96241,'ruRU','Немного о токсинах','Извлеките с помощью экстрактора яда 5 |4образец:образца:образцов; яда из обглоданных трупов на Мрачной вершине.','Тут на Мрачной вершине что-то странное творится. Старина Мазу''кон не раз уже слыхал об этих противных тварях, что шастают тут, будто у себя дома. Поговаривают, некоторые из этих ползучников ядовитые, и их яд обладает какими-то особыми свойствами – вот это мне страсть как интересно. Возьми мой экстрактор и собери немного яда с трупов, что валяются тут неподалеку. Буду тебе очень признателен, дружище.'),
(96241,'zhCN','[Talkin'' bout Toxins, Mon]','[Use the Toxin Extractor to gather 5 Gloomrise Toxin Samples from the Gnawed Corpses at Gloomrise.]','[Something funny be happenin'' over there at Gloomrise. Ol'' Mazu''kon be hearin all about these nasty new beasties skitterin'' all around there. Some say those creepy crawlies got a venom that have some unique properties and this be gettin'' me curious. Take my extractor. Use it on the dead bodies layin'' around that place to harvest the venom. Do this and I be in ya debt, mon.]'),
(96241,'zhTW','[Talkin'' bout Toxins, Mon]','[Use the Toxin Extractor to gather 5 Gloomrise Toxin Samples from the Gnawed Corpses at Gloomrise.]','[Something funny be happenin'' over there at Gloomrise. Ol'' Mazu''kon be hearin all about these nasty new beasties skitterin'' all around there. Some say those creepy crawlies got a venom that have some unique properties and this be gettin'' me curious. Take my extractor. Use it on the dead bodies layin'' around that place to harvest the venom. Do this and I be in ya debt, mon.]'),
(96260,'deDE','Härter als Stahl','Sammelt 3 Stränge kristalline Seide von Spinnern der Düsteranhöhe.','Habt Ihr gehört, was die Begräbnisstätte bei der Düsteranhöhe heimgesucht hat? Riesige Spinnen haben sich dort wie ein Lauffeuer ausgebreitet, und deren Gift ist Gerüchten zufolge so stark, dass es Tote wecken kann. Eine üble Angelegenheit, wenn Ihr mich fragt. Einer der Späher, der zur Untersuchung ausgesandt wurde, ist halbtot zurückgekehrt – bedeckt mit einer unglaublich widerstandsfähigen, kristallinen Spinnenseide. Ich habe so viele Proben entnommen, wie ich konnte, aber ich würde es sehr schätzen, für weitere Studien zusätzliche Proben dieser Seide zu haben. Bringt mir mehr dieser kristallinen Seide und ich werde Euch dafür belohnen.'),
(96260,'esES','[Stronger than Steel]','[Gather 3 strands of Crystalline Silk from Gloomrise Spinners.]','[Have you heard what befell the burial ground at Gloomrise? Giant spiders--rumored to have a venom so strong that it can wake the dead--have spread like wildfire. Nasty business, if you ask me. One of the scouts dispatched to investigate returned half dead and covered in an incredibly resilient, crystalline spider silk. I harvested what I could, but I would highly value more samples of this silk for additional study. Bring me more of this crystalline silk and I will reward you.]'),
(96260,'esMX','[Stronger than Steel]','[Gather 3 strands of Crystalline Silk from Gloomrise Spinners.]','[Have you heard what befell the burial ground at Gloomrise? Giant spiders--rumored to have a venom so strong that it can wake the dead--have spread like wildfire. Nasty business, if you ask me. One of the scouts dispatched to investigate returned half dead and covered in an incredibly resilient, crystalline spider silk. I harvested what I could, but I would highly value more samples of this silk for additional study. Bring me more of this crystalline silk and I will reward you.]'),
